nce-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#state-and-revision","content":"| Method    | Returns   | Notes                                              |\n| --------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `mutable` | `boolean` | Whether a state-owning timeline uses mutable mode. |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"3036":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-13","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#state-and-revision","content":"| Method             | Returns    | Notes                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `isTravels(value)` | Type guard | Detects state-owning timelines from this copy of Travels. |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"3037":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-14","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                         | Availability           | Purpose                                                 |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `setState(updater, metadata?)` | State-owning timelines | Commit a direct value, returned state, or draft recipe. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3038":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-15","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                       | Availability           | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `transaction(metadata?, fn)` | State-owning timelines | Atomically group synchronous operations; one root event. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3039":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-16","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                 | Availability           | Purpose                    |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `batch(metadata?, fn)` | State-owning timelines | Alias for `transaction()`. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3040":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-17","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                        | Availability        | Purpose                                                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `recordPatches(state, entry)` | Controlled journals | Record an external owner’s exact forward/inverse patch pair. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3041":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-18","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method               | Availability              | Purpose                              |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `archive(metadata?)` | Manual timelines/journals | Commit pending updates as one entry. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3042":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-19","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method         | Availability              | Purpose                        |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `canArchive()` | Manual timelines/journals | Check whether work is pending. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3043":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-20","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"Updater and transaction callbacks must be synchronous. Controlled journals do not expose `setState()`, transactions, tracking controls, or `getControls()`.","locale":"en"},"3044":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-21","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"| Method          | Purpose                            |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `back(amount?)` | Undo one or more retained entries. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"3045":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-22","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"| Method             | Purpose                            |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `forward(amount?)` | Redo one or more retained entries. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"3046":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-23","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"| Method         | Purpose                             |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `go(position)` | Jump to a retained cursor position. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"3047":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-24","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"| Method                       | Purpose                        |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `canBack()` / `canForward()` | Check navigation availability. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"3048":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-25","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"| Method          | Purpose              |\n| --------------- | -------------------- |\n| `getPosition()` | Read current cursor. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"3049":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-26","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"| Method    | Purpose                                                   |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reset()` | Restore the existing instance baseline through the owner. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"3050":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-27","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#navigation","content":"Navigation publishes `go`. Manual pending work is archived as part of successful navigation. Controlled journals delegate patch application through `apply` and must not record that navigation again as a new external edit.","locale":"en"},"3051":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-28","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#baseline-and-tracking","content":"| Method     | Purpose                                                 |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `rebase()` | Keep current state and discard all past/future history. |","locale":"en","table":"table-3"},"3052":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-29","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#baseline-and-tracking","content":"| Method                                | Purpose                                              