","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#拦截与修改操作","content":"包装 `setState()` 时必须保留被替代契约的两部分：把可选的第二个 `metadata` 参数继续传递下去，否则调用方附加到历史条目上的标签就会丢失；同时允许函数更新器修改草稿或返回新状态。下面的每个示例都兼顾了这两点。","locale":"zh"},"5536":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#拦截与修改操作","content":"`replaceStateWithoutHistory()` 通过 `setState()` 应用更新，所以 `setState()` 包装器对它同样生效。除非该调用抛出异常，否则它会清空历史记录。因此，如果包装器通过提前返回来阻止更新（校验和节流示例就是如此），旧状态会保留，但不会留下任何可撤销的内容。若要阻止替换并保留历史记录，应改为抛出异常，就像常见模式中的 `withValidation()` 那样；此时 `replaceStateWithoutHistory()` 会抛出同一个错误。","locale":"zh"},"5537":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#添加权限检查","content":"包装方法以在执行前验证权限：","locale":"zh"},"5538":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#自动为状态变更添加元数据","content":"包装 `setState`，将时间戳或用户 ID 之类的元数据注入状态。若想改为标记历史条目，请把字段加入包装器转发的 `metadata` 参数——`getMetadata()` 会为每个条目返回这份元数据。","locale":"zh"},"5539":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#实现操作日志与审计","content":"包装方法，在执行前后记录所有操作：","locale":"zh"},"5540":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#实现限流与节流","content":"包装方法以控制其调用频率：","locale":"zh"},"5541":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#组合多个包装器","content":"创建一个可复用的函数，一次性应用多项增强：","locale":"zh"},"5542":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#检测历史溢出","content":"使用 `subscribe()` 检测历史记录何时达到上限：","locale":"zh"},"5543":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#常见模式","content":"以下是一些可复用的包装器模式：","locale":"zh"},"5544":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns#返回主文档","content":"基本用法、API 参考和入门指南见主 README。","locale":"zh"},"5545":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"page","content":"归档模式","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","locale":"zh"},"5546":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","content":"选择自动生成的条目，或通过手动归档显式分组待处理更新。","locale":"zh"},"5547":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动归档默认方式","content":"自动归档：默认方式","locale":"zh"},"5548":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动归档","content":"手动归档","locale":"zh"},"5549":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#元数据选择","content":"元数据选择","locale":"zh"},"5550":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#导航会隐式归档待处理内容","content":"导航会隐式归档待处理内容","locale":"zh"},"5551":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动模式下的事务","content":"手动模式下的事务","locale":"zh"},"5552":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#相互抵消的待处理变更","content":"相互抵消的待处理变更","locale":"zh"},"5553":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"自动与手动","locale":"zh"},"5554":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","content":"归档模式决定生效的状态变更何时成为可撤销的历史条目。它不改变当前状态更新的时机：手动模式下，待处理的编辑已经体现在当前状态中。","locale":"zh"},"5555":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动归档默认方式","content":"当每次调用都代表一个完整的用户操作时，使用自动模式。空操作更新不会创建条目。自动时间线在运行时和 TypeScript 类型中都不提供 `archive()` 和 `canArchive()`。","locale":"zh"},"5556":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动归档","content":"手动模式适用于：","locale":"zh"},"5557":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动归档","content":"在失焦或保存时提交一组字段；","locale":"zh"},"5558":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动归档","content":"把一次拖拽手势当作一步；","locale":"zh"},"5559":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动归档","content":"由外部表单管理器决定撤销边界；","locale":"zh"},"5560":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动归档","content":"组合多次更新，而不立即把它们暴露为多个独立的撤销条目。","locale":"zh"},"5561":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#元数据选择","content":"`archive(metadata?)` 接受该条目最终的元数据。如果省略，Travels 会使用最近一次传给待处理 `setState()` 调用的元数据。","locale":"zh"},"5562":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#元数据选择","content":"持久化历史记录时，要确保元数据也被持久化。","locale":"zh"},"5563":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#导航会隐式归档待处理内容","content":"存在待处理的手动变更时，调用 `back()`、`forward()` 或 `go()` 会把这些变更作为导航的一部分归档，使游标位置仍然有意义。归档与移动会作为一次可观察的转换一并提交。","locale":"zh"},"5564":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#导航会隐式归档待处理内容","content":"在 Travels 3 中，这只会发布一个 `go` 事件，并使 `getRevision()` 推进一次。每个已提交事件都应触发持久化，而不只是 `archive` 事件。","locale":"zh"},"5565":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动模式下的事务","content":"根 `transaction()` 会在提交时归档。事务开始前已经待处理的变更会并入其条目，因此撤销时它们会一起回退。事务元数据优先；如果未提供，则使用最近一次待处理更新的元数据。","locale":"zh"},"5566":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#手动模式下的事务","content":"如果事务自身的更新相互抵消，更早的待处理内容可能继续保持待处理。完整的行为对照见事务。","locale":"zh"},"5567":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#相互抵消的待处理变更","content":"相互抵消的待处理变更会被丢弃，而不会保留为有意义的撤销条目。即使最终没有净状态变更，`archive()` 仍可为归档操作本身发布 `archive` 事件。导航在计算位置时会把待处理条目计入，因此其行为遵循导航契约，而不是简单地删除该条目。","locale":"zh"},"5568":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"| 行为                    | 自动  | 手动    |\n| --------------------- | --- | ----- |\n| 生效的 `setState()` 创建条目 | 立即  | 仅在归档后 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5569":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"| 行为     | 自动  | 手动  |\n| ------ | --- | --- |\n| 当前状态更新 | 立即  | 立即  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5570":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"| 行为                           | 自动  | 手动  |\n| ---------------------------- | --- | --- |\n| `archive()` / `canArchive()` | 不提供 | 可用  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5571":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"| 行为   | 自动     | 手动          |\n| ---- | ------ | ----------- |\n| 典型边界 | 一次更新调用 | 应用定义的手势或提交点 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5572":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"| 行为  | 自动     | 手动           |\n| --- | ------ | ------------ |\n| 根事务 | 一个分组条目 | 还会归档更早的待处理内容 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5573":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode#自动与手动","content":"从自动模式开始。只有当应用有明确的提交边界时才选择手动模式；从未归档的更新无法作为一个独立的已完成步骤进行导航。","locale":"zh"},"5574":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","type":"page","content":"Journal","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","locale":"zh"},"5575":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","content":"通过 Journal 将 Travels 历史记录接入已经拥有状态并负责提交的运行时。","locale":"zh"},"5576":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"数据流","locale":"zh"},"5577":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"导航与重置契约","locale":"zh"},"5578":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"公开接口","locale":"zh"},"5579":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#失败边界","content":"失败边界","locale":"zh"},"5580":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#事件兼容性","content":"事件兼容性","locale":"zh"},"5581":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","content":"`createTravelJournal()` 是面向已经拥有状态并负责提交的运行时提供的 Journal（受控日志）适配器 API。它让该运行时把现有的正向/反向补丁对交给 Travels，而无需重新执行更新逻辑，也不必让导航绕开状态所有者的校验与订阅流程。","locale":"zh"},"5582":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","content":"如果应由 Travels 自己拥有状态更新，请改用 `createTravels()`。使用 `restoreTravelJournal(snapshot, { apply })` 恢复序列化的 Journal 历史；快照状态与时间线会作为一个原子输入被接受。","locale":"zh"},"5583":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"一次外部提交只有一条权威路径：","locale":"zh"},"5584":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"状态所有者针对一次状态转换生成 `nextState`、`patches` 和 `inversePatches`。","locale":"zh"},"5585":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"所有者通过其常规状态路径提交 `nextState`。","locale":"zh"},"5586":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"在同一个同步提交边界内，适配器调用 `journal.recordPatches(nextState, { patches, inversePatches, metadata })`。","locale":"zh"},"5587":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"Travels 分离补丁对与元数据，更新游标和保留的历史记录，然后发布一个 `recordPatches` 事件。","locale":"zh"},"5588":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"当传入的状态引用发生变化时，`recordPatches()` 要求补丁对非空。它会校验补丁结构和受支持的补丁值，但不会重放该补丁对来证明它能把前一状态转换为传入的状态。这一对应关系由适配器负责；在此处做重放校验会重复外部运行时的工作，也会破坏只生成一次补丁的集成路径。","locale":"zh"},"5589":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"如果所有者无法回滚已发布的提交，可以在第 2 步之前调用 `assertTravelHistoryEntryRecordable({ patches, inversePatches })`。这项预检使用与 `recordPatches()` 相同的结构校验和分离值规则，但不会改变 Journal 状态。","locale":"zh"},"5590":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#数据流","content":"补丁组和元数据在 Travels 保留它们之前会被克隆。传入的状态仍作为外部所有者的状态引用，不会被克隆。","locale":"zh"},"5591":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"`back()`、`forward()`、`go()` 和 `reset()` 会组合必要的补丁并调用所需的 `apply` 回调：","locale":"zh"},"5592":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"回调会收到：","locale":"zh"},"5593":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"`state`：导航前 Travels 所知的状态；","locale":"zh"},"5594":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"`patches`：组合后的、待提交的正向转换；","locale":"zh"},"5595":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"`inversePatches`：组合后的回滚转换；","locale":"zh"},"5596":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"`fromPosition` 与 `toPosition`：游标的移动。","locale":"zh"},"5597":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"`reset()` 同样以补丁描述其返回基线的过程。当当前状态与基线同为普通对象或同为数组时，这些补丁会覆盖根的各个条目并保留根本身，因此所有者可以就地应用它们，例如使用 Mutative 的 `apply(state, patches, { mutable: true })`。当根类型不同、状态不是对象，或任一根含有自有 `__proto__` 键（任何补丁路径都无法指名该键）时，该转换会用单个 `{ op: 'replace', path: [] }` 补丁替换根。就地应用转换的所有者必须自行处理该补丁，正如处理通过 `recordPatches()` 记录的根替换一样：Mutative 2 对就地应用的根替换会抛出异常，Mutative 1 会跳过它，导致所有者的状态未变而 Journal 却已移动。","locale":"zh"},"5598":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"传入的转换包含已分离的补丁操作与值，因此回调意外修改它们也无法改写保留的历史记录。回调仍应把它们视为只读，因为在所有者提交之前修改它们会改变所请求的导航。如果补丁值包含函数、访问器、`WeakMap`/`WeakSet`、自定义类实例、数组子类，或其他无法在不改变运行时类型的前提下克隆的值，都会以 `UNCLONEABLE_PATCH_VALUE` 拒绝；Journal 应保留原始类型、普通对象、普通数组或 `Date` 值。`apply` 必须同步完成，并返回所有者实际提交的状态。抛出错误、无法克隆的转换，或类 Promise 的返回值，都不会推进游标、替换保留的状态引用或改变历史记录。","locale":"zh"},"5599":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"在开发构建中，Travels 还会扫描返回的状态中是否含有 `Map` 和 `Set`，不支持的状态会以同样的原子性被拒绝：游标、保留的状态引用和历史记录均保持不变。该扫描的耗时与整个状态成正比，因此生产构建会跳过它，每次导航都无需承担这部分开销。它只是一种诊断手段，让所有者尽早知道哪个转换引入了不支持的值，并不是保证持久化可靠性的机制：`serialize()`、`rebase()` 和 `getHistorySnapshot()` 在所有构建中都会校验状态，受控补丁值也始终会被校验，因此不支持的值绝不会进入保留的历史记录或持久化快照。请在开发构建下开发，以保留这一早期信号。对于外部所有者已经执行、随后操作才失败的修改或其他副作用，Travels 无法撤销。","locale":"zh"},"5600":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"在执行委托给它的导航或重置时，所有者必须关闭常规的提交记录。若把这些变更再送回 `recordPatches()`，会创建新条目，而不是移动或清空现有时间线。对于在 `apply` 中同步尝试的每一次 Journal 变更，Travels 都会以 `REENTRANT_MUTATION` 拒绝；所有者回调仍可执行读取操作。","locale":"zh"},"5601":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#导航与重置契约","content":"当多次外部提交应合并为一个撤销步骤时，设置 `autoArchive: false`。每次 `recordPatches()` 调用都会更新待处理的当前状态；`archive(metadata?)` 组合待处理的补丁组，`canArchive()` 报告是否有待处理的工作。归档只改变 Journal 历史，不会调用 `apply`，因为外部所有者已经提交了状态。当导航隐式归档待处理的工作时，归档与游标移动会作为一个可观察的导航转换提交；若 `apply` 失败，待处理的归档、修订号和订阅都保持不变。","locale":"zh"},"5602":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"返回的 `TravelJournal` 只暴露 Journal 可安全执行的操作：","locale":"zh"},"5603":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"外部提交入口：`recordPatches()`；","locale":"zh"},"5604":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"导航：`back()`、`forward()`、`go()`、`reset()`、`canBack()` 和 `canForward()`；","locale":"zh"},"5605":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"读取：`getState()`、`getHistory()`、`getHistorySnapshot()`、`getPosition()`、`getPatches()`、`getMetadata()`、`getHistoryEntries()`、`assertPersistenceCompatible()` 和 `serialize()`；","locale":"zh"},"5606":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"生命周期：`subscribe()` 和 `rebase()`；","locale":"zh"},"5607":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"仅手动 Journal：`archive()` 和 `canArchive()`。","locale":"zh"},"5608":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"在所有构建中，该接口对象都是冻结的只读能力视图；其方法无法在运行时被替换。","locale":"zh"},"5609":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#公开接口","content":"拥有状态的操作（`setState()`、事务、`replaceStateWithoutHistory()`、跟踪控制以及 `getControls()`）在公开类型和运行时接口对象中都不存在。若要在保留当前外部状态作为新基线的同时清空保留的历史记录，`rebase()` 是安全的方式；`reset()` 则请求外部所有者恢复现有基线。","locale":"zh"},"5610":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#失败边界","content":"Travels 保证每次 Journal 变更在内部都是原子的：格式错误、为空或只有单向的补丁对、不安全路径、不支持的补丁/状态值、元数据克隆失败以及受控导航失败，都不会部分改变 Journal 状态或历史记录。受控补丁入口采用与持久化历史相同的结构归一化，并同样保证访问器安全。","locale":"zh"},"5611":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#失败边界","content":"外部所有者与 Travels 仍然是两个组件。如果所有者已经发布提交，而 `recordPatches()` 随后失败，Travels 无法自动回滚那次外部提交。应通过可信的生产者生成补丁，保持元数据可克隆，并在所有者支持该顺序时先调用 `recordPatches()` 再发布外部通知。无法回滚的适配器应显式恢复，例如在权威状态处对 Journal 进行变基，或切换到其文档化的兼容回退方案。","locale":"zh"},"5612":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#失败边界","content":"观察者失败发生在 Journal 提交成功之后，遵循常规的 `onObserverError` 契约；它们不会回滚该转换。","locale":"zh"},"5613":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#事件兼容性","content":"一次成功的外部提交会发出类型为 `recordPatches` 的 `TravelsEvent`。导航会发出 `go`，包括通过 `back()` 或 `forward()` 发起的调用。事件中的补丁组只描述该事件自身的转换。","locale":"zh"},"5614":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal#事件兼容性","content":"`TravelsEvent['type']` 有意保持开放，以接纳未来次要版本新增的事件名。使用方应处理已知操作，并保留 `default` 分支，而不是用 `never` 断言穷尽性。仅使用 `createTravels()` 的应用在运行时不会收到 `recordPatches`。","locale":"zh"},"5615":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","type":"page","content":"错误处理","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","locale":"zh"},"5616":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","content":"在不损坏历史记录的前提下处理带类型的操作错误、持久化失败、警告和观察者错误。","locale":"zh"},"5617":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"操作错误","locale":"zh"},"5618":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"持久化错误","locale":"zh"},"5619":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#警告","content":"警告","locale":"zh"},"5620":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#观察者失败","content":"观察者失败","locale":"zh"},"5621":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"按边界恢复","locale":"zh"},"5622":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","content":"Travels 将操作错误、持久化解码错误、非致命警告和观察者失败区分开来。应匹配稳定的 `code` 值，而不是生产环境中的错误消息文本。","locale":"zh"},"5623":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"`TravelsError` 继承自 `Error`；`TravelsTypeError` 继承自 `TypeError`。两者都暴露稳定的 `code` 和可选的 `cause`。","locale":"zh"},"5624":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"常见错误码包括：","locale":"zh"},"5625":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码              | 典型含义           |\n| ---------------- | -------------- |\n| `ASYNC_CALLBACK` | 更新器或事务返回了异步工作。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5626":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码              | 典型含义               |\n| ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `INVALID_OPTION` | 工厂函数或恢复选项不兼容或格式错误。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5627":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                 | 典型含义               |\n| ------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `INVALID_OPERATION` | 请求的操作在该能力或状态下不被允许。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5628":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                 | 典型含义               |\n| ------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `UNSUPPORTED_STATE` | 状态或补丁路径违反了运行时状态契约。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5629":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                        | 典型含义               |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `PERSISTENCE_INCOMPATIBLE` | 状态、补丁、路径或元数据无法持久化。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5630":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                     | 典型含义                |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `HISTORY_REPLAY_FAILED` | 导航或重建期间无法应用某个保留的补丁。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5631":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                  | 典型含义                |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `TRANSACTION_FAILED` | 原子操作失败；请检查 `cause`。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5632":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                  | 典型含义               |\n| -------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `REENTRANT_MUTATION` | 同步观察者或受控回调尝试了嵌套变更。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5633":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                                         | 典型含义              |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `INVALID_PATCH_ENTRY` / `EMPTY_PATCH_ENTRY` | 受控补丁对格式错误或缺少所需操作。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5634":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                       | 典型含义         |\n| ------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `UNCLONEABLE_PATCH_VALUE` | 受控补丁值无法安全分离。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5635":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                           | 典型含义           |\n| ----------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `CONTROLLED_JOURNAL_REQUIRED` | 该操作需要 Journal。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5636":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"| 错误码                                | 典型含义                  |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `CONTROLLED_OPERATION_UNAVAILABLE` | 从 Journal 请求了拥有状态的能力。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5637":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"异步事务会抛出错误码为 `TRANSACTION_FAILED` 的 `TravelsError`。无论传入原生 async 函数，还是在普通函数中返回 Promise，均可通过 `cause` 上的 `TravelsTypeError` 和 `ASYNC_CALLBACK` 识别原因。","locale":"zh"},"5638":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#操作错误","content":"核心操作失败会被包装，可通过 `onError` 处理，尤其是在协调嵌套事务时。如果 UI 必须同步处理某些操作的错误，请在操作周围保留本地 `try/catch`；不要以为钩子会取代抛出的错误。","locale":"zh"},"5639":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"`TravelsPersistenceError` 涵盖解码、迁移和校验：","locale":"zh"},"5640":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码           | 含义            |\n| ------------- | ------------- |\n| `PARSE_ERROR` | 无法解析 JSON 输入。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5641":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码                   | 含义          |\n| --------------------- | ----------- |\n| `UNSUPPORTED_VERSION` | 不支持该快照模式版本。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5642":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码              | 含义               |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| `INVALID_SCHEMA` | 快照字段、元数据或位置格式错误。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5643":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码               | 含义              |\n| ----------------- | --------------- |\n| `INVALID_PATCHES` | 补丁容器、操作、路径或值无效。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5644":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码               | 含义            |\n| ----------------- | ------------- |\n| `INVALID_HISTORY` | 语义重放或可逆性检查失败。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5645":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码                | 含义                   |\n| ------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `MIGRATION_FAILED` | 迁移回调失败，或返回了无效/异步的结果。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5646":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"| 错误码               | 含义                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------ |\n| `FALLBACK_FAILED` | 恢复失败，或产生了无效/异步的结果。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"5647":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#持久化错误","content":"针对具体条目的语义失败还可能暴露 `entryIndex` 和 `direction`。参见迁移与恢复。","locale":"zh"},"5648":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#警告","content":"`onWarning` 接收带有稳定错误码的非致命诊断信息：","locale":"zh"},"5649":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#警告","content":"警告码包括 `HISTORY_DISABLED`、`HISTORY_DISCARDED`、`HISTORY_TRIMMED`、`INVALID_POSITION`、`MUTABLE_FALLBACK`、`MUTABLE_ROOT_REPLACEMENT`、`PERSISTENCE_COMPATIBILITY` 和 `POSITION_CLAMPED`。","locale":"zh"},"5650":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#警告","content":"未配置该钩子时，警告仅在开发环境写入控制台。禁用兼容性警告不会禁用运行时正确性检查。","locale":"zh"},"5651":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#观察者失败","content":"提交之后，由监听器、devtools、分支丢弃钩子、错误/警告钩子或兼容性检查抛出的错误，会在配置了 `onObserverError` 时路由到该钩子。这些错误不会中断其他观察者，也不会回滚已经提交的转换。未配置该钩子时，开发构建会通过 `console.error` 输出观察者来源和原始错误。","locale":"zh"},"5652":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#观察者失败","content":"观察者的 Promise 不会被等待，但被拒绝的 Promise 会被隔离并上报。实际的异步副作用恢复仍由应用负责。","locale":"zh"},"5653":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"**调用方输入无效：** 在构建时间线之前修正选项或状态；不要带着部分初始化的所有者继续执行。","locale":"zh"},"5654":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"**事务失败：** Travels 会回滚通过其 API 完成的写入。应用的副作用以及对可变 Store 的直接写入需要单独处理。","locale":"zh"},"5655":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"**未经校验的持久化历史：** 在恢复前使用 `validation: 'semantic'` 和已知安全的 `fallback`。","locale":"zh"},"5656":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"**受控入口：** 当所有者无法回滚已发布的变更时，在外部提交前调用 `assertTravelHistoryEntryRecordable()`。","locale":"zh"},"5657":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"**受控 `apply` 失败：** Travels 不会推进自己的游标，但无法撤销外部所有者已经执行的副作用。","locale":"zh"},"5658":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"**可变模式下的重放失败：** 失败补丁之前的写入可能会保留。恢复未经校验的快照前，应优先进行语义校验。","locale":"zh"},"5659":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling#按边界恢复","content":"为保证完整性与防篡改，应在反序列化之前于 Travels 之外校验编码后的字节；仅凭重放一致性无法证明来源。","locale":"zh"},"5660":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","type":"page","content":"历史记录指南","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides","locale":"zh"},"5661":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides","content":"关于更新、导航、分组、观察者、所有权与失败处理的实用指南。","locale":"zh"},"5662":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides#日常操作","content":"日常操作","locale":"zh"},"5663":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides#所有权与生命周期","content":"所有权与生命周期","locale":"zh"},"5664":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides#生产环境行为","content":"生产环境行为","locale":"zh"},"5665":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides","content":"这些指南讲解第一个撤销按钮跑通之后真正重要的行为。建议先阅读更新与导航，再选择与你的应用匹配的归档和所有权模型。","locale":"zh"},"5666":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#日常操作","content":"<Card title=\"更新状态\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state\" description=\"草稿函数、替换值、元数据、同步边界与空操作更新。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5667":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#日常操作","content":"<Card title=\"导航与控件\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls\" description=\"撤销、重做、跳转、修订号、历史视图与精简的 UI 控件。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5668":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#日常操作","content":"<Card title=\"归档模式\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/archive-mode\" description=\"决定待处理的变更何时成为可撤销的条目。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5669":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#日常操作","content":"<Card title=\"事务\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/transactions\" description=\"原子化的多步编辑、嵌套、回滚与观察者语义。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5670":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#所有权与生命周期","content":"<Card title=\"跟踪与替换\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement\" description=\"暂停历史记录、接受远程状态，并建立新的基线。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5671":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#所有权与生命周期","content":"<Card title=\"可变模式\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode\" description=\"在不丢失补丁的前提下保持响应式对象引用稳定。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5672":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#所有权与生命周期","content":"<Card title=\"Journal\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/controlled-journal\" description=\"通过外部状态所有者的提交路径记录历史。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5673":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#生产环境行为","content":"<Card title=\"观察者与事件\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events\" description=\"已提交的事件对象、只读视图、devtools 与错误隔离。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5674":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#生产环境行为","content":"<Card title=\"错误处理\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/error-handling\" description=\"稳定的错误码、警告、观察者失败与恢复边界。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5675":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides#生产环境行为","content":"<Card title=\"进阶模式\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides/advanced-patterns\" description=\"校验、权限、元数据、日志记录与可组合包装器。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5676":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"page","content":"可变模式","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","locale":"zh"},"5677":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","content":"在记录可逆补丁的同时，保持响应式对象引用不变。","locale":"zh"},"5678":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#何时应该启用可变模式","content":"何时应该启用可变模式","locale":"zh"},"5679":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#启用可变模式","content":"启用可变模式","locale":"zh"},"5680":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#内部实现","content":"内部实现","locale":"zh"},"5681":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#将持久化的历史记录恢复到实时-store","content":"将持久化的历史记录恢复到实时 Store","locale":"zh"},"5682":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"各操作的行为","locale":"zh"},"5683":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"回退与安全边界","locale":"zh"},"5684":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#集成模式","content":"集成模式","locale":"zh"},"5685":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#mobx简化版可观察对象","content":"MobX（简化版可观察对象）","locale":"zh"},"5686":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#vue--pinia","content":"Vue / Pinia","locale":"zh"},"5687":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#手动归档--可变模式","content":"手动归档 + 可变模式","locale":"zh"},"5688":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#事务--可变状态","content":"事务 + 可变状态","locale":"zh"},"5689":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#性能与测试说明","content":"性能与测试说明","locale":"zh"},"5690":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#排查清单","content":"排查清单","locale":"zh"},"5691":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#小结","content":"小结","locale":"zh"},"5692":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","content":"可变模式让 Travels 能与依赖**稳定对象引用**来通知订阅者的可观察状态库（MobX、Vue 的 `reactive`、Pinia Store 等）配合使用。每次更新时，Travels 不再替换整个状态对象，而是就地修改原对象，同时仍然记录用于撤销/重做的 JSON Patch。","locale":"zh"},"5693":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","content":"本指南帮助你判断何时启用 `mutable: true`、理解其内部机制，并在生产应用中安全使用。","locale":"zh"},"5694":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#何时应该启用可变模式","content":"你交给 Travels 的对象正是 UI 库所观察的对象，并且一旦替换该引用就会破坏响应式（MobX Store、Vue/Pinia Store、自定义代理）。","locale":"zh"},"5695":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#何时应该启用可变模式","content":"你希望获得撤销/重做能力，又不愿引入额外的 `setState({...state})` 副本或垃圾回收开销。","locale":"zh"},"5696":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#何时应该启用可变模式","content":"你使用 `autoArchive: false` 批量更新，但仍希望实时 Store 引用立即更新。","locale":"zh"},"5697":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#何时应该启用可变模式","content":"如果你已经在替换引用（React/Redux 风格的 reducer、Zustand 等），或者更看重用于 diff 的结构共享，请继续使用默认的不可变模式。","locale":"zh"},"5698":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#启用可变模式","content":"经过这次普通的草稿更新后，`travels.getState()` 仍然返回 `store`。实际生效的变更仍会生成补丁，但显式的根替换和原始类型根可能改变根引用，具体见下文。","locale":"zh"},"5699":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#内部实现","content":"`createTravels` 将你传入的对象保留为实时状态，并为 `reset()` 存储一份分离的基线副本：尽可能使用 `structuredClone()`，否则回退到自定义深拷贝。","locale":"zh"},"5700":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#内部实现","content":"每次针对对象根的普通草稿更新都会经过 Mutative 的 `create(...)` 生成补丁/反向补丁。这些补丁随即通过 `apply(..., { mutable: true })` 应用回实时对象，从而保持其引用不变。显式的根替换则改用不可变回退路径。","locale":"zh"},"5701":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#内部实现","content":"导航命令（`back`、`forward`、`go`）复用已存储的补丁。`reset()` 则重新计算到该基线副本的差异，因此无需重放每一步历史记录就能恢复原始数据。","locale":"zh"},"5702":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#内部实现","content":"如果某个历史步骤替换了整个根（补丁路径为 `[]` 且 `op: 'replace'`），Travels 会在该次跳转中回退到不可变赋值，以确保正确性。","locale":"zh"},"5703":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#内部实现","content":"完整实现位于 `src/travels.ts`，并由 `test/mutable-mode.test.ts` 和 `test/primitive-edge-cases.test.ts` 覆盖。","locale":"zh"},"5704":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#将持久化的历史记录恢复到实时-store","content":"`restoreTravels(snapshot)` 恢复的是快照状态的分离副本，对于已经被观察的 Store 来说，这会破坏响应式。应改为把被观察的对象作为 `target` 传入：","locale":"zh"},"5705":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#将持久化的历史记录恢复到实时-store","content":"Travels 在记录任何内容之前，会先用 `snapshot.state` 的副本就地覆盖 `target`，因此实时对象与恢复后的补丁历史总是从同一份数据开始。快照本身永远不会被修改。`target` 要求 `mutable: true`，并且其根类型（普通对象或数组）必须与快照状态一致；两个根都不得含有自有 `__proto__` 键，不满足时会以 `INVALID_OPTION` 拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"5706":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作         | 是否保留引用 | 说明                                 |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `setState` | 通常     | 局部草稿更新会保留对象/数组根；原始类型根和显式根替换使用不可变回退 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5707":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作                 | 是否保留引用         | 说明                      |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `back` / `forward` | 是，除非该步骤应用了根级替换 | 当你撤销的变更替换了整个状态对象或类型时会发生 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5708":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作             | 是否保留引用                | 说明                              |\n| -------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `go(position)` | 与 `back`/`forward` 相同 | Travels 会先检查是否存在根替换补丁，再决定能否就地修改 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5709":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作            | 是否保留引用 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `archive`（手动） | 是      | 临时补丁会合并并应用到同一实时对象 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5710":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作      | 是否保留引用 | 说明                                                            |\n| ------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reset` | 通常     | 仅当当前状态与存储的初始快照同为普通对象或同为数组，且二者都没有自有 `__proto__` 键时就地修改；否则重新赋值根 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5711":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作           | 是否保留引用 | 说明                                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `getHistory` | 混合     | 包含当前位置的实时状态。过去与未来的条目与其共享未变更的对象，因此就地更新也会改变先前返回的数组；如需保留副本，请使用 `getHistorySnapshot()` |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5712":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#各操作的行为","content":"| 操作          | 是否保留引用  | 说明                      |\n| ----------- | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `subscribe` | 接收当前实时根 | 就地操作会保留其引用；根替换步骤可能提供新的根 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5713":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**不自动冻结**：`enableAutoFreeze` 不能与 `mutable: true` 同时使用。当 `enableAutoFreeze` 为字面量 `true` 时，TypeScript 会对这一组合报错，工厂函数也会在运行时以 `INVALID_OPTION` 拒绝。冻结每个生成的状态还会冻结它与实时对象共享的部分，导致下一次写入这些部分的更新抛出异常。","locale":"zh"},"5714":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**非对象根**：如果当前状态是原始类型或 `null`，Travels 会记录一条开发警告，并在该次更新中采用不可变行为。撤销/重做仍然有效——只是无法就地修改原始类型。","locale":"zh"},"5715":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**历史记录中的根替换**：导航到替换整个根的步骤（例如从 `{...}` 切换到 `[]` 或原始类型）时，仅该次跳转会强制使用新引用。","locale":"zh"},"5716":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**无法重放的历史记录**：导航会将保留的补丁就地应用到实时对象。如果某个补丁无法应用（例如通过了默认结构校验的损坏快照），`go()` 会抛出 `HISTORY_REPLAY_FAILED`，且此前完成的写入会保留。在事务中，回滚会尽可能撤销，若某些变更无法撤销，则抛出 `TRANSACTION_FAILED`，并将该错误作为其 `cause`。恢复不可信快照之前，请先用 `Travels.deserialize(snapshot, { validation: 'semantic' })` 校验。","locale":"zh"},"5717":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**返回新根的函数更新器**：在可变模式下，替换根的 `setState(() => newState)` 在该次更新中回退为不可变赋值（会发出开发警告）。","locale":"zh"},"5718":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**根上的自有 `__proto__` 键**：`JSON.parse` 会把 `\"__proto__\"` 成员变成自有键。Mutative 草稿无法通过赋值接收该键，Mutative 也不会应用指向它的补丁路径，因此当值更新或 `reset()` 的当前根或新根含有该键时，会替换根而不是就地覆盖。","locale":"zh"},"5719":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**重置基线是一份副本**：`reset()` 会回到一份状态副本，该副本取自创建或恢复时，或由最近一次 `rebase()`、`replaceStateWithoutHistory()` 或跟踪暂停期间的更新刷新。副本尽可能使用 `structuredClone()`，否则使用深拷贝回退，因此 `Date`、`undefined`、`NaN`、`-0` 和 `bigint` 都能保留。可被结构化克隆的类实例会丢失原型；无法克隆的值（例如函数和不支持的运行时对象）可以通过回退路径按引用保留。两种模式都会重置到相同的数据。","locale":"zh"},"5720":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**分离的历史值**：可变时间线会通过结构化克隆加回退机制，将补丁中的对象值分离，因此之后对克隆数据的就地写入无法改写历史记录。通过 `mark` 进入草稿处理、且结构化克隆能够处理的类实例，在撤销或重做将其插入时会以普通对象返回；只能走回退路径的值则可以保留其引用和运行时类型。对保持在原位的实例字段的编辑会保留该实例，而不可变时间线自始至终保留实例。","locale":"zh"},"5721":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#回退与安全边界","content":"**草稿最佳实践**：优先修改提供的草稿（`draft.count++`），而不是返回一个全新对象。修改草稿能让 Travels 在导航期间继续使用就地补丁。","locale":"zh"},"5722":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#vue--pinia","content":"响应式的 `state` 引用与 Vue 组件绑定的是同一个对象，因此组件能立即看到变更，同时仍保留撤销/重做控制。","locale":"zh"},"5723":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#手动归档--可变模式","content":"由于状态是就地修改的，分组变更执行期间 UI 会持续更新。这个辅助函数定义的是手动归档边界，而非原子事务；当你需要回滚以及单个稳定后的观察者事件时，请使用 `travels.transaction()`。","locale":"zh"},"5724":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#事务--可变状态","content":"`travels.transaction(...)` 会把 Travels 操作产生的反向补丁记入日志。如果回调失败，这些已记录的变更会被还原，而实时状态对象保持其引用不变。直接写入该对象不会产生 Travels 补丁，因此它不在日志之中，回滚后依然保留：","locale":"zh"},"5725":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#事务--可变状态","content":"凡是必须纳入事务回滚边界的变更，都应使用 `travels.setState(...)`。Travels 的监听器和 devtools 只发布稳定后的根事务，但直接挂在实时对象上的 MobX、Vue、Pinia 或其他观察者会在临时性的就地变更发生时看到它们。","locale":"zh"},"5726":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#性能与测试说明","content":"可变模式仍会生成 JSON Patch，因此你可以像在不可变模式下一样持久化或检查差异。","locale":"zh"},"5727":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#性能与测试说明","content":"专门的 `test/mutable-mode.test.ts` 测试套件验证了在 `setState`、`back`、`forward`、`go`、`reset`、`archive` 和 `subscribe` 过程中引用保持稳定。","locale":"zh"},"5728":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#性能与测试说明","content":"`test/bug-fixes.test.ts` 和 `test/coverage-improvements.test.ts` 包含针对重置嵌套对象、删除多余属性以及处理稀疏数组的回归测试（可变值更新会回退为不可变方式以保留空位）。","locale":"zh"},"5729":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#排查清单","content":"**根引用是否意外改变了？** 检查该历史步骤是否替换了整个状态（例如 `setState(() => newState)` 返回了一个全新对象）。优先使用草稿修改来避免这种情况。","locale":"zh"},"5730":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#排查清单","content":"**在手动归档模式下看不到更新？** 记住 `travels.setState` 仍会立即修改对象；`archive()` 只决定哪些变更会成为可撤销的条目。","locale":"zh"},"5731":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#排查清单","content":"**看到关于原始类型的警告？** 请确保根状态是对象。如果需要可变语义，可以把原始类型包装起来（`{ value: 0 }`）。","locale":"zh"},"5732":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#排查清单","content":"**需要在运行时确认模式？** 查看 `travels.mutable`。它会返回当前模式，编写集成测试时很方便。","locale":"zh"},"5733":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/mutable-mode#小结","content":"可变模式让 Travels 拥有响应式 Store 的使用体验，同时不放弃基于补丁的历史记录。当普通操作需要引用稳定时启用它；持久化时遵守持久数据契约；并优先使用草稿修改。只要严格的根引用同一性很重要，就查阅上面的操作表。","locale":"zh"},"5734":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","type":"page","content":"导航与控件","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","locale":"zh"},"5735":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","content":"在历史记录中移动，并向 UI 组件暴露恰当的只读能力。","locale":"zh"},"5736":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#撤销重做与跳转","content":"撤销、重做与跳转","locale":"zh"},"5737":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#reset-与-rebase-的区别","content":"`reset()` 与 `rebase()` 的区别","locale":"zh"},"5738":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#面向组件的精简控件","content":"面向组件的精简控件","locale":"zh"},"5739":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"共享视图与自有快照","locale":"zh"},"5740":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#由元数据驱动的撤销菜单","content":"由元数据驱动的撤销菜单","locale":"zh"},"5741":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#撤销重做与跳转","content":"用 `canBack()` 和 `canForward()` 判断按钮是否可用。`getPosition()` 返回当前游标，订阅事件中的 `historyLength` 给出保留的步数。","locale":"zh"},"5742":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#撤销重做与跳转","content":"`back()` 和 `forward()` 会把导航作为 `go` 事件发布。手动模式下待处理的变更会在导航成功时被隐式归档；Travels 3 只发布一个稳定后的 `go` 事件，而不会分别发布 `archive` 和 `go` 事件。","locale":"zh"},"5743":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#reset-与-rebase-的区别","content":"`reset()` 回到当前实例的基线。","locale":"zh"},"5744":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#reset-与-rebase-的区别","content":"`rebase()` 丢弃全部历史记录，并把当前状态设为新的基线。","locale":"zh"},"5745":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#reset-与-rebase-的区别","content":"两者都会修改时间线并通知观察者。它们的含义并非总是“回到最早保留的补丁”；在把它们作为产品操作暴露之前，请先阅读历史记录生命周期。","locale":"zh"},"5746":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#面向组件的精简控件","content":"`getControls()` 返回一个缓存且冻结的接口对象，适合用于按钮、菜单和组件 props：","locale":"zh"},"5747":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#面向组件的精简控件","content":"该接口对象包含导航、当前位置、只读的补丁与历史视图，以及 `rebase()`。手动时间线会暴露能感知手动模式的控制类型。`setState()` 等拥有状态的方法不在其中。","locale":"zh"},"5748":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#面向组件的精简控件","content":"`archive()` 和 `rebase()` 可能在不改变当前状态引用的情况下改变控件。每个已提交的订阅者事件都会让 `getRevision()` 推进一次，因此它才是 `useSyncExternalStore` 的正确快照。","locale":"zh"},"5749":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"| API            | 所有权            | 用途         |\n| -------------- | -------------- | ---------- |\n| `getHistory()` | 共享的缓存只读数组与状态视图 | 即时渲染与读取时间线 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5750":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"| API                    | 所有权             | 用途                  |\n| ---------------------- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| `getHistorySnapshot()` | 与缓存分离、归调用方所有的状态 | 持有、排序、编辑、传递给 Worker |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5751":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"| API            | 所有权          | 用途             |\n| -------------- | ------------ | -------------- |\n| `getPatches()` | 与缓存分离的保留补丁数据 | 自有副本、自定义序列化、分析 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5752":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"| API                | 所有权       | 用途             |\n| ------------------ | --------- | -------------- |\n| `controls.patches` | 共享的缓存只读视图 | 渲染时读取与 memo 依赖 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5753":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"| API                   | 所有权            | 用途                 |\n| --------------------- | -------------- | ------------------ |\n| `getHistoryEntries()` | 带反向补丁和元数据的补丁条目 | 撤销菜单、devtools、审计视图 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5754":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#共享视图与自有快照","content":"绝不要通过类型断言去掉只读限制来修改共享缓存。可变时间线还可能就地更新旧的共享历史视图；当某个历史值必须保持不变时，请使用与共享缓存分离的快照。","locale":"zh"},"5755":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/navigation-and-controls#由元数据驱动的撤销菜单","content":"元数据的索引与保留的补丁条目对齐。历史记录被裁剪时，被裁掉条目的标签也会一同消失；菜单文案应基于当前保留的条目生成，而不是另外维护一份没有边界限制的 UI 列表。","locale":"zh"},"5756":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"page","content":"观察者与事件","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","locale":"zh"},"5757":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","content":"订阅已提交的状态转换，并安全使用共享的只读事件数据。","locale":"zh"},"5758":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"事件结构","locale":"zh"},"5759":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"事件局部补丁","locale":"zh"},"5760":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#共享事件对象与借用状态","content":"共享事件对象与借用状态","locale":"zh"},"5761":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#重入变更","content":"重入变更","locale":"zh"},"5762":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#观察者失败","content":"观察者失败","locale":"zh"},"5763":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#外部-store-的修订号","content":"外部 Store 的修订号","locale":"zh"},"5764":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#devtools","content":"Devtools","locale":"zh"},"5765":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","content":"对于一次已提交的通知，`subscribe()` 与 `devtools` 选项会收到同一个 `TravelsEvent` 对象。观察者在状态、游标和历史记录稳定之后运行。","locale":"zh"},"5766":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"| 字段     | 含义        |\n| ------ | --------- |\n| `type` | 已提交操作的名称。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5767":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"| 字段      | 含义         |\n| ------- | ---------- |\n| `state` | 借用的当前状态视图。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5768":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"| 字段        | 含义                         |\n| --------- | -------------------------- |\n| `patches` | 相对于上一次发布状态、仅属于该事件的正向/反向增量。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5769":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"| 字段         | 含义      |\n| ---------- | ------- |\n| `position` | 提交后的游标。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5770":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"| 字段              | 含义       |\n| --------------- | -------- |\n| `historyLength` | 保留的条目数量。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5771":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"| 字段         | 含义            |\n| ---------- | ------------- |\n| `metadata` | 与该操作关联的可选元数据。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5772":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"已知类型包括 `setState`、`recordPatches`、`archive`、`transaction`、`go`、`reset`、`rebase` 和 `replaceStateWithoutHistory`。`back()` 与 `forward()` 发布 `go`；受控的外部提交发布 `recordPatches`。","locale":"zh"},"5773":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件结构","content":"事件类型有意保持开放，以便次要版本添加操作。在应用的 `switch` 中应保留 `default` 分支，而不是用 `never` 断言穷尽性。","locale":"zh"},"5774":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"`event.patches` 只描述该次通知的转换，并不是 `getPatches()` 返回的完整保留历史记录。","locale":"zh"},"5775":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"根事务会把内部步骤组合成一个最终增量。","locale":"zh"},"5776":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"`archive()` 与 `rebase()` 可能在改变时间线控制的同时发布空的状态补丁。","locale":"zh"},"5777":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"补丁数据按需生成。","locale":"zh"},"5778":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"补丁容器、补丁组、操作以及数组路径都会被冻结。","locale":"zh"},"5779":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"正向与反向是彼此独立的克隆。","locale":"zh"},"5780":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#事件局部补丁","content":"嵌套值和元数据会从状态与保留的历史记录中分离，但可以由处理同一事件的多个观察者共享。请把整个事件视为只读；一个观察者不得改变后续观察者看到的内容。","locale":"zh"},"5781":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#共享事件对象与借用状态","content":"每次通知都会创建一个浅冻结的事件对象，供监听器和 devtools 共享。`event.state` 是时间线使用的实时状态，其类型为 `ReadonlyState<S>`。","locale":"zh"},"5782":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#共享事件对象与借用状态","content":"不要通过它写入。在不可变模式下，直接修改既可能绕过记录，也可能改变被保留补丁引用的对象。在可变模式下，应通过 Travels 写入，以保证补丁对和事务日志的正确性。","locale":"zh"},"5783":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#共享事件对象与借用状态","content":"如果需要分离的完整保留历史快照，请使用 `getPatches()`；如果观察者需要自己拥有的状态值，请使用 `structuredClone()`。","locale":"zh"},"5784":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#重入变更","content":"观察者同步调用会修改状态的 Travels API 时，这类调用会被拒绝，以防止嵌套转换混淆不同版本的事件：","locale":"zh"},"5785":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#重入变更","content":"读取操作仍然可用。请谨慎设计派生状态，避免后续更新造成无休止的通知循环。","locale":"zh"},"5786":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#观察者失败","content":"监听器抛出的异常会与其他观察者隔离，并且不会回滚已提交的转换。配置 `onObserverError` 可接收结构化的失败信息：","locale":"zh"},"5787":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#观察者失败","content":"来源包括 `listener`、`devtools`、`onBranchDiscard`、`onError`、`onWarning` 和 `compatibilityCheck`。观察者返回的 Promise 不会被等待；被拒绝的 Promise 会被隔离，并通过同一路径上报。不要把观察者当作事务校验器——应在提交前完成校验。","locale":"zh"},"5788":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#外部-store-的修订号","content":"`getRevision()` 是一个 O(1) 的单调递增令牌。每个已提交的订阅者事件都会使其前进一次，包括在状态引用未变时手动调用 `archive()` 和 `rebase()` 的情况。空操作更新和失败的事务不会推进它。","locale":"zh"},"5789":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#外部-store-的修订号","content":"因此，修订号是 React 及其他外部 Store 绑定正确的失效信号。","locale":"zh"},"5790":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/observers-and-events#devtools","content":"Devtools 遵循与订阅者相同的提交后、共享视图和错误隔离规则。请保持 devtools 的工作轻量，避免同步修改时间线，并复制需要比事件存活更久的数据。","locale":"zh"},"5791":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","type":"page","content":"跟踪与替换","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","locale":"zh"},"5792":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","content":"在历史记录之外应用更新、替换权威状态，并在需要时重置历史基线。","locale":"zh"},"5793":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#暂停与恢复跟踪","content":"暂停与恢复跟踪","locale":"zh"},"5794":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#替换状态且不记录历史","content":"替换状态且不记录历史","locale":"zh"},"5795":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#以当前状态变基","content":"以当前状态变基","locale":"zh"},"5796":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#重置到现有基线","content":"重置到现有基线","locale":"zh"},"5797":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#远程同步注意事项","content":"远程同步注意事项","locale":"zh"},"5798":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","content":"并非每次状态变更都应该成为撤销步骤。Travels 提供了独立的工具，分别用于暂停跟踪、替换文档，以及围绕当前状态清空历史记录。","locale":"zh"},"5799":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#暂停与恢复跟踪","content":"暂停期间，每次实际改变状态的更新都会清空过去、未来和待归档的历史条目。更新后的状态成为位置 0，也是以后 `reset()` 返回的基线。在事务外，订阅者会收到 `replaceStateWithoutHistory` 事件。暂停后直接恢复，或只执行未产生改动的更新，都会保留历史。","locale":"zh"},"5800":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#暂停与恢复跟踪","content":"如果后续更新不应创建历史条目，使用 `pauseTracking()`；随后用 `resumeTracking()` 恢复正常记录：","locale":"zh"},"5801":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#暂停与恢复跟踪","content":"暂停期间发生的更新会成为新基线的一部分，因此后续的撤销/重做不会在不匹配的状态上重放保留的补丁。务必在 `finally` 中恢复跟踪；让跟踪一直处于暂停状态，会在无提示的情况下改变后续编辑的含义。","locale":"zh"},"5802":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#暂停与恢复跟踪","content":"请谨慎用于那些不应对历史记录可见的同步或水合操作。对于普通的用户编辑，直接使用 `setState()`，不要暂停跟踪。","locale":"zh"},"5803":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#替换状态且不记录历史","content":"`replaceStateWithoutHistory(updater)` 会应用一个直接值或草稿函数，清空保留的历史记录，并让结果成为新的基线：","locale":"zh"},"5804":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#替换状态且不记录历史","content":"它很适合切换文档、接受来自服务器的权威快照，或重置外部 Store 的数据。它会有意丢弃旧时间线。","locale":"zh"},"5805":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#替换状态且不记录历史","content":"如果更新抛出异常，替换和清空历史记录都不会提交。拦截 `setState()` 的包装器也会针对本次操作执行，因为替换会通过这条路径应用更新。静默返回的包装器可能留下一条历史记录已清空但状态未变的时间线；当被阻止的替换必须保留历史记录时，应抛出异常。","locale":"zh"},"5806":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#以当前状态变基","content":"与替换不同，`rebase()` 不会载入新状态。它会保留当前状态（包括尚未归档的临时补丁），并丢弃所有保留的过去和未来历史记录：","locale":"zh"},"5807":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#以当前状态变基","content":"当当前状态成为干净的起点时使用它。Journal 将 `rebase()` 作为在保留外部持有的状态的同时清空历史记录的安全方式。","locale":"zh"},"5808":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#重置到现有基线","content":"`reset()` 回到基线，而不是创建新的基线。基线可能是最初创建时的状态、经过校验的恢复基线，也可能是之后某次变基、替换或暂停更新所产生的结果。","locale":"zh"},"5809":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#重置到现有基线","content":"| 操作                     | 改变当前状态   | 清空历史记录    | 建立新基线 |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- | ----- |\n| `pauseTracking()` + 更新 | 是，通过更新函数 | 是，发生实际变更时 | 是     |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5810":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#重置到现有基线","content":"| 操作                             | 改变当前状态   | 清空历史记录 | 建立新基线 |\n| ------------------------------ | -------- | ------ | ----- |\n| `replaceStateWithoutHistory()` | 是，通过更新函数 | 是      | 是     |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5811":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#重置到现有基线","content":"| 操作         | 改变当前状态 | 清空历史记录 | 建立新基线   |\n| ---------- | ------ | ------ | ------- |\n| `rebase()` | 否      | 是      | 是，以当前状态 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5812":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#重置到现有基线","content":"| 操作        | 改变当前状态 | 清空历史记录 | 建立新基线    |\n| --------- | ------ | ------ | -------- |\n| `reset()` | 是，回到基线 | 是      | 否，沿用现有基线 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5813":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/tracking-and-replacement#远程同步注意事项","content":"Travels 不会合并并发编辑，也不会消解冲突。在替换或变基本地状态之前，先确定文档标识、修订号顺序和冲突处理方式。当历史记录的来源很重要时，应在反序列化或替换之前，在 Travels 之外校验远程快照。参见安全与完整性。","locale":"zh"},"5814":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"page","content":"事务","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","locale":"zh"},"5815":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","content":"把多次同步更新归入一个原子历史条目，并只产生一个稳定后的观察者事件。","locale":"zh"},"5816":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#一个逻辑撤销步骤","content":"一个逻辑撤销步骤","locale":"zh"},"5817":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#原子回滚","content":"原子回滚","locale":"zh"},"5818":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#仅支持同步回调","content":"仅支持同步回调","locale":"zh"},"5819":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#嵌套","content":"嵌套","locale":"zh"},"5820":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#相互抵消的更新","content":"相互抵消的更新","locale":"zh"},"5821":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#可变模式边界","content":"可变模式边界","locale":"zh"},"5822":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#选择事务还是手动归档","content":"选择事务还是手动归档","locale":"zh"},"5823":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","content":"当多个 Travels 操作构成一次逻辑编辑时，使用 `transaction()`。`batch()` 是它的别名，重载和行为完全相同。","locale":"zh"},"5824":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#一个逻辑撤销步骤","content":"根事务会把自身的更新组合成一个历史条目。状态监听器和 devtools 在提交后只会收到一个最终的 `transaction` 事件，而不是每个内部步骤各收到一个临时的 `setState` 事件。","locale":"zh"},"5825":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#一个逻辑撤销步骤","content":"可以省略元数据，也可以把它作为第一个参数传入：","locale":"zh"},"5826":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#原子回滚","content":"如果回调抛出异常，Travels 会回滚通过其 API 所做的更改，既不发布临时状态，也不发布回滚补偿事件。","locale":"zh"},"5827":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#原子回滚","content":"在适当的情况下，失败会报告为 `TRANSACTION_FAILED`，底层错误可通过 `cause` 获取。`onError` 会在根事务稳定之后观察错误，因此永远不会看到嵌套事务尚未稳定的中间状态。","locale":"zh"},"5828":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#仅支持同步回调","content":"不要传入异步函数，也不要让回调返回 Promise。请在开始事务之前等待网络和存储操作完成：","locale":"zh"},"5829":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#仅支持同步回调","content":"异步回调被拒绝时会触发回滚，并报告为异步回调失败。事务之所以能具备原子性的历史记录和观察者边界，前提正是它保持同步。","locale":"zh"},"5830":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#嵌套","content":"在根事务提交之前，嵌套事务始终保持私有。观察者事件、devtools、分支丢弃通知和 `onError` 都以根事务稳定后的结果为准。","locale":"zh"},"5831":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#嵌套","content":"成功的嵌套工作会并入根操作。","locale":"zh"},"5832":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#嵌套","content":"在嵌套作用域中向上冒泡的失败只会报告一次。","locale":"zh"},"5833":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#嵌套","content":"完全在临时工作中创建并丢弃的重做分支，不会被当作外部可见的已丢弃历史记录上报。","locale":"zh"},"5834":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#嵌套","content":"提交后不要在观察者中同步修改时间线；应改为调度后续工作。","locale":"zh"},"5835":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#相互抵消的更新","content":"如果事务修改了某个字段又将其恢复为原值，就可能成为空操作：不产生条目、不发布事件、不推进修订号，重做分支也保持原样。这与单次空操作的 `setState()` 一致。","locale":"zh"},"5836":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#相互抵消的更新","content":"如果事务还执行了导航、归档或重置，那么即使状态更新相互抵消，该时间线操作仍可能发布事件。在手动模式下，自身更新相互抵消的事务可能让更早的待处理变更继续保持待处理状态；其他成功的根事务则会把更早的待处理工作归档到自己的条目中。","locale":"zh"},"5837":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#可变模式边界","content":"可变模式下的回滚只会为通过 Travels API 完成的写入重放反向补丁。直接写入实时对象的操作不在日志范围内，并能在回滚后保留：","locale":"zh"},"5838":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#可变模式边界","content":"凡是必须共享事务边界的写入，都应通过 `setState()` 完成。直接挂在实时对象上的 MobX、Vue 或 Pinia 观察者能看到临时的原地写入，而 Travels 观察者只会看到根事务稳定后的事件。","locale":"zh"},"5839":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/transactions#选择事务还是手动归档","content":"对于同步、原子、只需一个最终事件并支持回滚的操作，使用**事务**。如果更新是随时间逐步发生的，例如在一次拖拽期间、跨越多个字段事件，或直到应用定义的提交点，并且希望当前状态立即可见，则使用**手动归档模式**。","locale":"zh"},"5840":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"page","content":"更新状态","breadcrumbs":["Travels","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","locale":"zh"},"5841":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","content":"正确使用草稿修改、替换值、元数据与同步更新。","locale":"zh"},"5842":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#草稿修改推荐","content":"草稿修改（推荐）","locale":"zh"},"5843":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#直接替换","content":"直接替换","locale":"zh"},"5844":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#返回新状态的函数","content":"返回新状态的函数","locale":"zh"},"5845":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#同步边界","content":"同步边界","locale":"zh"},"5846":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#元数据","content":"元数据","locale":"zh"},"5847":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#空操作更新","content":"空操作更新","locale":"zh"},"5848":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#读取状态通过-travels-写入","content":"读取状态，通过 Travels 写入","locale":"zh"},"5849":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#提交前校验","content":"提交前校验","locale":"zh"},"5850":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","content":"拥有状态的时间线通过 `setState(updater, metadata?)` 接收更新。外部日志有意不提供这个方法，而是由状态所有者记录已经生成的补丁对。","locale":"zh"},"5851":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#草稿修改推荐","content":"Mutative 默认会把草稿函数的修改转换为不可变结果，并把正向和反向补丁交给 Travels。草稿修改通常能产生最精确的操作，并在可变模式下保留原地修改行为。","locale":"zh"},"5852":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#直接替换","content":"如果确实有意替换根状态，可以直接传入值。在可变模式下，替换根状态可能需要回退到不可变路径，因此对于要求引用稳定的 Store，更推荐在草稿中做局部修改。","locale":"zh"},"5853":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#返回新状态的函数","content":"返回 `undefined` 的函数会被当作草稿函数，而不是要求把状态设为 `undefined`。如果 `undefined` 确实是下一个状态，并且应用能够接受随之而来的持久化后果，就直接传入 `undefined`。","locale":"zh"},"5854":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#同步边界","content":"更新回调必须同步执行完毕。异步函数和类 Promise 的结果会被拒绝，以免后续异步代码在历史记录的转换过程之外修改状态。","locale":"zh"},"5855":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#元数据","content":"元数据用于标记条目，同时不会把产品层面的关注点混入文档状态：","locale":"zh"},"5856":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#元数据","content":"用 `getMetadata()` 读取与当前位置对应的元数据，用 `getHistoryEntries()` 读取条目。观察者事件会暴露当前操作的元数据。当时间线会被序列化时，自定义值必须遵守与状态相同的持久化契约。","locale":"zh"},"5857":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#空操作更新","content":"不产生任何补丁的更新不会创建历史条目，不会发布订阅者事件，也不会推进 `getRevision()`：","locale":"zh"},"5858":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#空操作更新","content":"这样，重复的表单通知和幂等操作就不会使历史记录膨胀。一次替换是否算作变更，由 Mutative 的值语义决定；用一个相等但不同的对象替换原值，仍然可能产生补丁。","locale":"zh"},"5859":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#读取状态通过-travels-写入","content":"`getState()` 返回历史记录实际使用的当前状态对象，类型为 `S`，以便与 Store 互操作。请把它当作只读数据：","locale":"zh"},"5860":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#读取状态通过-travels-写入","content":"在不可变模式下启用 `enableAutoFreeze`，可以让意外修改直接失败。把值交给必须修改它的代码之前，先用 `structuredClone()` 复制一份。","locale":"zh"},"5861":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/updating-state#提交前校验","content":"最简单的校验边界在更新函数内部，或者在调用更新函数之前。抛出异常可以阻止操作提交。如果你包装 `setState()` 来加入共享校验，需要同时转发更新函数和可选的元数据，保留草稿修改与返回新状态两种行为，并在历史记录必须保持不变时抛出异常，而不是静默返回。完整的包装器示例见进阶模式。","locale":"zh"},"5862":{"id":"/zh/docs","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"page","content":"Travels 文档","breadcrumbs":["Travels"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs","locale":"zh"},"5863":{"id":"/zh/docs-0","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"学习、集成并运维 Travels 3 的基于补丁的撤销/重做。","locale":"zh"},"5864":{"id":"/zh/docs-1","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"按目标开始","locale":"zh"},"5865":{"id":"/zh/docs-2","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#一分钟完成一个完整示例","content":"一分钟完成一个完整示例","locale":"zh"},"5866":{"id":"/zh/docs-3","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"什么时候适合使用 Travels","locale":"zh"},"5867":{"id":"/zh/docs-4","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"公开构建模块","locale":"zh"},"5868":{"id":"/zh/docs-5","page_id":"/zh/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs#项目资源","content":"项目资源","locale":"zh"},"5869":{"id":"/zh/docs-6","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"Travels 是一个与框架无关的状态历史引擎，为应用提供可靠的撤销/重做能力。它记录正向与反向 JSON Patch，因此状态庞大、编辑频繁而细微的应用也能保留紧凑的时间线，将其持久化，并在之后恢复。","locale":"zh"},"5870":{"id":"/zh/docs-7","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"你可以用熟悉的修改语法编写更新。Travels 默认通过 Mutative 生成不可变状态；可变模式与 Journal 则支持响应式 Store 和由外部持有的状态。","locale":"zh"},"5871":{"id":"/zh/docs-8","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs","content":"第 3 版采用显式工厂函数、唯一的原子持久化恢复路径、只读共享视图，并将“拥有状态的时间线”和“外部 Journal”拆分为不同能力。正在升级？请先阅读迁移指南。","locale":"zh"},"5872":{"id":"/zh/docs-9","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"<Card title=\"安装并构建时间线\" href=\"/zh/docs/getting-started/installation\" description=\"环境要求、安装依赖，以及一个最小可运行示例。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5873":{"id":"/zh/docs-10","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"<Card title=\"理解历史模型\" href=\"/zh/docs/concepts/how-it-works\" description=\"状态、补丁、位置、归档、分支与基线。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5874":{"id":"/zh/docs-11","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"<Card title=\"接入你的框架\" href=\"/zh/docs/integrations\" description=\"React、Vue、Zustand、MobX、Pinia、表单与外部 Store。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5875":{"id":"/zh/docs-12","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"<Card title=\"持久化完整历史\" href=\"/zh/docs/persistence\" description=\"序列化、校验、恢复、迁移并修复时间线快照。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5876":{"id":"/zh/docs-13","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"<Card title=\"掌握进阶行为\" href=\"/zh/docs/guides\" description=\"事务、手动归档、事件、可变状态与 Journal。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5877":{"id":"/zh/docs-14","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#按目标开始","content":"<Card title=\"查阅精确 API\" href=\"/zh/docs/api-reference\" description=\"每个导出的函数、类、接口、类型别名与变量。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5878":{"id":"/zh/docs-15","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#一分钟完成一个完整示例","content":"下一步是快速开始，它会逐一解释这条流程中的每个部分。","locale":"zh"},"5879":{"id":"/zh/docs-16","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"Travels 针对历史体积、持久化和可重放的操作日志进行了优化。它尤其适合可视化编辑器、表单搭建器、本地优先应用、工作流设计器，以及其他需要让用户安全探索的编辑场景。","locale":"zh"},"5880":{"id":"/zh/docs-17","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"| 你的优先级            | 推荐方案    |\n| ---------------- | ------- |\n| 状态大、更新小、需要长期保留历史 | Travels |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5881":{"id":"/zh/docs-18","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"| 你的优先级           | 推荐方案    |\n| --------------- | ------- |\n| 需要持久化或传输撤销/重做历史 | Travels |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5882":{"id":"/zh/docs-19","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"| 你的优先级                 | 推荐方案        |\n| --------------------- | ----------- |\n| 状态小、只需短期本地历史、追求最低更新延迟 | 快照栈可能更简单也更快 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5883":{"id":"/zh/docs-20","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"| 你的优先级     | 推荐方案                            |\n| --------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 多用户并发冲突消解 | 使用 CRDT/OT 系统；Travels 本身不负责冲突消解 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5884":{"id":"/zh/docs-21","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"| 你的优先级       | 推荐方案              |\n| ----------- | ----------------- |\n| 每次更新都替换完整状态 | 按你的工作负载比较快照与补丁的成本 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5885":{"id":"/zh/docs-22","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#什么时候适合使用-travels","content":"完整的取舍讨论见选择合适的方案。","locale":"zh"},"5886":{"id":"/zh/docs-23","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"`createTravels()` 创建一条由 Travels 掌管状态更新的时间线。","locale":"zh"},"5887":{"id":"/zh/docs-24","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"`createPatchableTravels()` 为持久化状态增加编译期与即时运行时校验。","locale":"zh"},"5888":{"id":"/zh/docs-25","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"`createTravelJournal()` 记录来自外部状态所有者的补丁对。","locale":"zh"},"5889":{"id":"/zh/docs-26","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"`restoreTravels()` 与 `restoreTravelJournal()` 恢复经过完整校验的快照。","locale":"zh"},"5890":{"id":"/zh/docs-27","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"`Travels.deserialize()` 解码、迁移并校验持久化输入。","locale":"zh"},"5891":{"id":"/zh/docs-28","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"`getControls()` 为 UI 组件暴露一个窄而只读的导航接口。","locale":"zh"},"5892":{"id":"/zh/docs-29","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#公开构建模块","content":"所有导出都记录在 API 参考中。","locale":"zh"},"5893":{"id":"/zh/docs-30","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#项目资源","content":"Travels 采用 MIT 许可，使用 TypeScript 编写。你可以在文档的示例页面找到可运行示例，或浏览 GitHub 仓库。官方绑定包括 React 的 use-travel 和 Zustand 的 zustand-travel。","locale":"zh"},"5894":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","type":"page","content":"表单与外部 Store","breadcrumbs":["Travels","框架集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","locale":"zh"},"5895":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","content":"让表单管理器或状态运行时保持权威，同时加入可靠的撤销/重做历史。","locale":"zh"},"5896":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#表单值的分离副本配合手动归档","content":"表单值的分离副本配合手动归档","locale":"zh"},"5897":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#键盘快捷键","content":"键盘快捷键","locale":"zh"},"5898":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#何时使用-journal","content":"何时使用 Journal","locale":"zh"},"5899":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#决策指南","content":"决策指南","locale":"zh"},"5900":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","content":"当另一个库掌管状态时，要避免制造两个彼此独立的响应式事实来源。可以选择把状态的分离副本同步到拥有状态的时间线，也可以选择由所有者实际提交的补丁驱动的 Journal。","locale":"zh"},"5901":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#表单值的分离副本配合手动归档","content":"当表单管理器提供 `getValues()` 以及用于重置或设置值的 API，但尚不生成 JSON Patch 时，这种模式很合适。","locale":"zh"},"5902":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#表单值的分离副本配合手动归档","content":"表单值变化时调用 `syncToHistory()`，并在失焦、保存或防抖后的提交等有意义的产品边界上调用 `commitHistoryStep()`。两个方向都要克隆当前值：这样表单管理器之后就无法修改 Travels 保留的状态对象，Travels 也不会保留仍然活动的表单对象。","locale":"zh"},"5903":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#表单值的分离副本配合手动归档","content":"对于 `react-hook-form`，`getValues()` 与表单 API 天然对应，`reset()` 则可以用来实现 `setValues()`。","locale":"zh"},"5904":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#键盘快捷键","content":"返回的 `handleHistoryKeyDown` 同时支持 macOS 与 Windows 的修饰键，会规范化字母大小写，并且只在 Travels 能够处理该操作时才阻止浏览器默认行为。只有当产品的快捷键策略要求时，才忽略来自可编辑元素的事件目标：","locale":"zh"},"5905":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#键盘快捷键","content":"把监听器限定在当前活动的编辑器上，而不是为每个挂载的表单注册重复的全局处理器。","locale":"zh"},"5906":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#何时使用-journal","content":"当外部所有者已经能为每次提交生成精确的 `nextState`、`patches` 和 `inversePatches` 时，使用 `createTravelJournal()`。这样可以避免把更新逻辑执行两次，并让校验与订阅行为留在所有者正常的提交路径中。","locale":"zh"},"5907":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#何时使用-journal","content":"所有者不能把委托的导航再次记录为一次新编辑。`apply` 是同步的；如果所有者在部分提交之后失败，Travels 无法回滚外部副作用。在选择这条路径之前，先完整阅读Journal 契约。","locale":"zh"},"5908":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#决策指南","content":"表单或 Store 返回普通值，但不提供补丁：使用分离副本进行 `setState()` 同步。","locale":"zh"},"5909":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#决策指南","content":"多次变更通知应合并为一个撤销步骤：使用手动归档。","locale":"zh"},"5910":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#决策指南","content":"所有者已经生成精确的正向与反向补丁：使用 Journal。","locale":"zh"},"5911":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#决策指南","content":"需要向 Travels 观察者隐藏临时变更并自动回滚：在 Travels 掌管的更新外层使用同步事务。","locale":"zh"},"5912":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores#决策指南","content":"所有者无法回滚已经发布的提交：条件允许时，在发布前用 `assertTravelHistoryEntryRecordable()` 预检补丁条目。","locale":"zh"},"5913":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","type":"page","content":"框架集成","breadcrumbs":["Travels","框架集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations","locale":"zh"},"5914":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations","content":"为你的状态架构选择不可变、可变、官方绑定或外部持有的历史方案。","locale":"zh"},"5915":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"选择集成方式","locale":"zh"},"5916":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations#官方-v3-绑定","content":"官方 v3 绑定","locale":"zh"},"5917":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"集成不变式","locale":"zh"},"5918":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations","content":"Travels 的核心不依赖任何 UI 框架。合适的集成方式取决于状态由谁掌管，以及你的响应式系统需要的是新引用还是稳定的对象身份。","locale":"zh"},"5919":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者 | 推荐起点                                    | 历史模式 |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| React  | `useSyncExternalStore` 或 `use-travel@3` | 不可变  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5920":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者    | 推荐起点                  | 历史模式 |\n| --------- | --------------------- | ---- |\n| Vue 组合式函数 | `shallowRef`/`ref` 订阅 | 不可变  |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5921":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者                | 推荐起点       | 历史模式            |\n| --------------------- | ---------- | --------------- |\n| Vue 响应式 Store / Pinia | 直接传入被观察的对象 | `mutable: true` |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5922":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者  | 推荐起点                             | 历史模式        |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| Zustand | `zustand-travel@3` 或手动同步外部 Store | 不可变 / 由绑定掌管 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5923":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者 | 推荐起点      | 历史模式            |\n| ------ | --------- | --------------- |\n| MobX   | 直接传入可观察状态 | `mutable: true` |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5924":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者 | 推荐起点                         | 历史模式   |\n| ------ | ---------------------------- | ------ |\n| 表单管理器  | 表单值的分离副本配合手动归档，或使用外部 Journal | 取决于所有者 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5925":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"| 框架或所有者        | 推荐起点                    | 历史模式  |\n| ------------- | ----------------------- | ----- |\n| 状态机 / 现有补丁生成方 | `createTravelJournal()` | 由外部持有 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"5926":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"<Card title=\"React\" href=\"/zh/docs/integrations/react\" description=\"外部 Store 订阅、控制接口与组件所有权。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5927":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"<Card title=\"Vue\" href=\"/zh/docs/integrations/vue\" description=\"不可变组合式函数与引用稳定的响应式状态。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5928":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"<Card title=\"Zustand\" href=\"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand\" description=\"官方中间件与直接集成核心 API。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5929":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"<Card title=\"MobX 与 Pinia\" href=\"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia\" description=\"可变时间线，适用于依赖对象身份的 Store。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5930":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#选择集成方式","content":"<Card title=\"表单与外部 Store\" href=\"/zh/docs/integrations/external-stores\" description=\"单一所有者同步与委托导航。\" />","locale":"zh"},"5931":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#官方-v3-绑定","content":"`use-travel` 提供 React Hooks 与共享 Store 集成。","locale":"zh"},"5932":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#官方-v3-绑定","content":"`zustand-travel` 提供 Zustand 中间件。","locale":"zh"},"5933":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#官方-v3-绑定","content":"无论使用哪个 v3 绑定，都应搭配 `travels@^3.0.1`：`use-travel@3` 接受 `travels@^3.0.0`，`zustand-travel@3` 则要求 `travels@^3.0.1`。两个绑定都支持 `mutative@^2.0.0`。应使用相互匹配的主版本，使工厂函数重载、只读视图与快照恢复遵循同一份契约。","locale":"zh"},"5934":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"无论使用哪种框架：","locale":"zh"},"5935":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"为每个逻辑文档或编辑会话创建一条时间线。","locale":"zh"},"5936":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"只要订阅者仍依赖它，就保持其实例身份稳定。","locale":"zh"},"5937":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"只通过一条权威的状态更新路径进行更新。","locale":"zh"},"5938":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"状态或时间线修订号发生变化时，都要重新渲染。","locale":"zh"},"5939":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"所有者被销毁时取消订阅。","locale":"zh"},"5940":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"在受控关闭点之前完成待处理的持久化写入。","locale":"zh"},"5941":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations#集成不变式","content":"可运行的源码示例见示例。","locale":"zh"},"5942":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","type":"page","content":"MobX 与 Pinia","breadcrumbs":["Travels","框架集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","locale":"zh"},"5943":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","content":"通过可变时间线与显式的可撤销写入，保留可观察 Store 的对象身份。","locale":"zh"},"5944":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#mobx","content":"MobX","locale":"zh"},"5945":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#pinia-setup-store","content":"Pinia Setup Store","locale":"zh"},"5946":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#恢复到活动-store","content":"恢复到活动 Store","locale":"zh"},"5947":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#对象身份与根替换","content":"对象身份与根替换","locale":"zh"},"5948":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#事务与观察者","content":"事务与观察者","locale":"zh"},"5949":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","content":"MobX 与 Pinia 通常观察一个稳定的对象，而不期待不可变的根替换。用 `mutable: true` 创建 Travels，并传入组件所观察的同一个对象。","locale":"zh"},"5950":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#mobx","content":"对于普通的草稿更新，`store` 与 `travels.getState()` 仍是同一个引用。`back()` 与 `forward()` 会把补丁应用到该对象上，因此 MobX reaction 会继续运行。","locale":"zh"},"5951":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#pinia-setup-store","content":"应暴露 action，而不是让组件直接给 `state` 赋值。对于不进入历史的字段，直接写入 Pinia 或 MobX 可能是合适的，但这些写入对撤销和事务回滚都不可见。","locale":"zh"},"5952":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#恢复到活动-store","content":"恢复目标会被快照状态的分离副本就地覆盖。快照仍然可以复用，绝不会被当作活动 Store 对象本身使用。","locale":"zh"},"5953":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#对象身份与根替换","content":"优先对草稿做局部修改。原始类型根、显式根替换以及某些重置或导航场景可能需要回退到不可变方式。如果你的集成依赖严格的引用相等性，参见可变模式操作表。","locale":"zh"},"5954":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#对象身份与根替换","content":"不要在可变模式下启用 `enableAutoFreeze`。即使 MobX 或 Vue 能够观察 `Map` 和 `Set`，Travels 仍然不支持它们；先规范化集合，再传给 Travels。","locale":"zh"},"5955":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/mobx-pinia#事务与观察者","content":"事务只会把通过 Travels 完成的写入记入日志。直接修改 `store` 的内容在回滚后仍然保留。直接附加到对象上的框架观察者能看到临时变更，而 Travels 监听器只会看到一次最终落定的根事件。把副作用和直接写入放在原子文档更新之外，或为它们另行制定恢复策略。","locale":"zh"},"5956":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","type":"page","content":"React 集成","breadcrumbs":["Travels","框架集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","locale":"zh"},"5957":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","content":"使用 useSyncExternalStore 与基于修订号的失效机制，将 Travels 时间线绑定到 React。","locale":"zh"},"5958":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#可复用的外部-store-hook","content":"可复用的外部 Store Hook","locale":"zh"},"5959":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#由组件掌管的时间线","content":"由组件掌管的时间线","locale":"zh"},"5960":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#恢复后的共享时间线","content":"恢复后的共享时间线","locale":"zh"},"5961":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#副作用与持久化","content":"副作用与持久化","locale":"zh"},"5962":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#服务端渲染","content":"服务端渲染","locale":"zh"},"5963":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","content":"React 与 Travels 默认的不可变模式天然契合。用 `useSyncExternalStore` 订阅，以 `getRevision()` 作为触发失效的快照，并在渲染期间读取当前状态或控制接口。","locale":"zh"},"5964":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","content":"只需显示保留的步数时，在订阅回调中读取 `event.historyLength`。历史变更后，首次调用 `getHistory().length` 会重建历史状态，首次读取 `controls.patches` 会复制正反向补丁及其值。组件本来就要读取这些补丁时，可以顺便用 `controls.patches.patches.length` 取步数。","locale":"zh"},"5965":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#可复用的外部-store-hook","content":"`getRevision()` 之所以重要，是因为 `archive()` 与 `rebase()` 可能改变时间线的控制接口，却不改变状态引用。如果快照只依赖对象标识，撤销与重做按钮的可用状态就不会更新。","locale":"zh"},"5966":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#由组件掌管的时间线","content":"上面的示例创建了一条模块级共享时间线。如果每个组件实例都应拥有各自文档的历史，就为每个已挂载的所有者创建一次时间线，并保持其稳定：","locale":"zh"},"5967":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#由组件掌管的时间线","content":"不要在每次渲染时无条件调用 `createTravels()`。把 `initialState` 当作初始化输入；如果要加载另一份文档，应显式替换状态，或新建一个由新 key 标识的编辑器所有者，而不是在渲染期间静默重置历史。","locale":"zh"},"5968":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#恢复后的共享时间线","content":"在 React 外部完成恢复，然后订阅恢复后的实例：","locale":"zh"},"5969":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#恢复后的共享时间线","content":"如需官方基于 Hook 的 API，或要处理恢复后的共享时间线，可使用 `use-travel@3`。它的 `useTravelStore` 路径可以接受恢复后的 Travels 实例。","locale":"zh"},"5970":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#副作用与持久化","content":"把持久化订阅放在渲染路径之外。对异步写入做防抖，并在应用控制的关闭点完成这些写入：","locale":"zh"},"5971":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#副作用与持久化","content":"不要在渲染期间调用 `setState()`、`back()` 或其他时间线变更操作，也不要在 Travels 观察者中同步调用它们。事件处理器以及经过适当调度的 effect 或 task 能让转换保持有序。","locale":"zh"},"5972":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/react","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/react#服务端渲染","content":"`useSyncExternalStore` 的第三个参数提供服务端快照。保持服务端与客户端初始时间线数据一致，以免出现水合不匹配。模块级时间线在服务端由整个应用共享；如果数据因请求而异，应在合适的请求或客户端边界上划定所有权，而不是让不同用户共享同一份文档。","locale":"zh"},"5973":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","type":"page","content":"Vue 集成","breadcrumbs":["Travels","框架集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","locale":"zh"},"5974":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","content":"使用不可变 ref，或通过可变模式保留响应式 Store 的引用。","locale":"zh"},"5975":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#不可变组合式函数","content":"不可变组合式函数","locale":"zh"},"5976":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#可变的响应式状态","content":"可变的响应式状态","locale":"zh"},"5977":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#恢复到响应式状态","content":"恢复到响应式状态","locale":"zh"},"5978":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#变更与事务注意事项","content":"变更与事务注意事项","locale":"zh"},"5979":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","content":"Vue 支持 Travels 的两种所有权模式。如果能接受替换状态，就使用不可变模式搭配 ref；如果时间线必须更新组件所观察的同一个 `reactive()` 对象，则使用可变模式。","locale":"zh"},"5980":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#不可变组合式函数","content":"`shallowRef` 适合处理不可变的根替换，能避免把状态再深度包裹进一层响应式。`revision` 则让组件能感知仅涉及控制接口的变化，例如 `archive()` 和 `rebase()`。","locale":"zh"},"5981":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#不可变组合式函数","content":"当时间线的作用域限于组件时，在组合式函数所属组件卸载时调用 `dispose()`。应用级共享时间线则可以放在专门的 Store 模块中，并为其指定明确的所有者。","locale":"zh"},"5982":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#可变的响应式状态","content":"如果替换响应式对象的引用会破坏你的 Store 设计，就把同一个对象传给 Travels：","locale":"zh"},"5983":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#可变的响应式状态","content":"组件继续读取 `state`；Travels 针对同一个对象记录并应用补丁。不要将可变模式与 `enableAutoFreeze` 一起使用。","locale":"zh"},"5984":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#恢复到响应式状态","content":"`target` 要求启用可变模式，并且根必须是兼容的对象或数组。Travels 会用快照状态的分离副本就地覆盖它，让活动对象与恢复后的历史记录保持一致。","locale":"zh"},"5985":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#变更与事务注意事项","content":"直接绑定到可变状态的 Vue 侦听器可能在事务期间观察到临时写入，而 Travels 订阅者只会看到落定后的根事务。直接给 `state` 赋值会绕过 Travels，也不会被回滚。所有可撤销的写入都应通过 `travels.setState()` 完成。","locale":"zh"},"5986":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/vue#变更与事务注意事项","content":"完整 Store 示例见 MobX 与 Pinia，你也可以浏览 Vue 源码示例。","locale":"zh"},"5987":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","type":"page","content":"Zustand 集成","breadcrumbs":["Travels","框架集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","locale":"zh"},"5988":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","content":"使用 zustand-travel v3，或将核心的不可变时间线与 Zustand Store 同步。","locale":"zh"},"5989":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#官方中间件","content":"官方中间件","locale":"zh"},"5990":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#直接集成核心-api","content":"直接集成核心 API","locale":"zh"},"5991":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#单一权威更新路径","content":"单一权威更新路径","locale":"zh"},"5992":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","content":"对于新的 Zustand 应用，官方中间件 `zustand-travel@3` 是最直接的集成方式。当你需要独立的历史所有者或自定义持久化编排时，核心 API 仍然很有用。","locale":"zh"},"5993":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#官方中间件","content":"可选的 `snapshot` 提供一份完整恢复后的历史记录。不要同时传入拥有状态的 `Travels` 实例；时间线集成由绑定负责。初始化函数用于定义 action，快照数据则提供恢复后的基线。","locale":"zh"},"5994":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#官方中间件","content":"不需要恢复时，省略 `snapshot`，由初始化函数定义起始状态。关于该绑定返回的控制接口与 Hook API，参见该绑定自己的文档。","locale":"zh"},"5995":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#直接集成核心-api","content":"一个简单的手动适配器就能把不可变的 Travels 状态镜像到 Zustand：","locale":"zh"},"5996":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#直接集成核心-api","content":"该订阅还会同步撤销、重做、重置以及其他导航操作。让订阅一直保留到 Store 生命周期结束，或随应用 Store 一起释放。","locale":"zh"},"5997":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#直接集成核心-api","content":"对于手动 `archive()`、`rebase()` 这类仅涉及控制接口的更新，如果组件会读取 `controls.canBack()` 或 `controls.position`，且不会因其他原因重新渲染，也应把 `getRevision()` 一并镜像到 Store 中。","locale":"zh"},"5998":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#单一权威更新路径","content":"不要让一个 action 独立写入两个 Store，从而制造出彼此不一致的状态。要么让更新都经过 Travels，并镜像它已提交的状态；要么让 Zustand 保持权威，并使用官方绑定或 Journal。","locale":"zh"},"5999":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/zustand#单一权威更新路径","content":"如果独立表单或 Store 的所有者之后可能修改这些对象，就不要把仍然活动的可变引用未经克隆直接传给不可变 Travels。在集成边界上使用分离副本。","locale":"zh"},"6000":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"page","content":"迁移指南","breadcrumbs":["Travels","迁移"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration","locale":"zh"},"6001":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration","content":"升级到 Travels 3，或从基于快照的历史库迁移。","locale":"zh"},"6002":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-2x-升级到-30","content":"从 2.x 升级到 3.0","locale":"zh"},"6003":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过工厂函数创建时间线","content":"通过工厂函数创建时间线","locale":"zh"},"6004":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"只保留一个状态所有者","locale":"zh"},"6005":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从可变时间线中移除自动冻结","content":"从可变时间线中移除自动冻结","locale":"zh"},"6006":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#将共享视图视为只读","content":"将共享视图视为只读","locale":"zh"},"6007":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过单一校验路径恢复","content":"通过单一校验路径恢复","locale":"zh"},"6008":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#升级官方绑定","content":"升级官方绑定","locale":"zh"},"6009":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#导航在单个事件中归档待处理改动","content":"导航在单个事件中归档待处理改动","locale":"zh"},"6010":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"将 Mutative 升级到 2","locale":"zh"},"6011":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#更新观察者与运行时兼容性","content":"更新观察者与运行时兼容性","locale":"zh"},"6012":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"从 Redux-undo 迁移","locale":"zh"},"6013":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"从 Zundo 迁移","locale":"zh"},"6014":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"从 use-travel 迁移","locale":"zh"},"6015":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从位置参数订阅回调迁移","content":"从位置参数订阅回调迁移","locale":"zh"},"6016":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-mapset-状态迁移","content":"从 Map/Set 状态迁移","locale":"zh"},"6017":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/migration#持久化迁移","content":"持久化迁移","locale":"zh"},"6018":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-2x-升级到-30","content":"Travels 3 把状态所有权、外部 Journal、共享视图与持久化恢复拆分为各自独立的公开能力。","locale":"zh"},"6019":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过工厂函数创建时间线","content":"`Travels` 不再可构造，仅作为 `Travels.deserialize()` 的命名空间保留。","locale":"zh"},"6020":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过工厂函数创建时间线","content":"`instanceof Travels` 不再可用：右侧现在是普通对象，因此该表达式会在运行时抛出 `TypeError`，在 TypeScript 中也无法通过编译。请改用 `isTravels()` 判断时间线是否拥有状态：","locale":"zh"},"6021":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过工厂函数创建时间线","content":"时间线仍然是可扩展的普通对象，因此进阶模式指南中的方法包装写法依旧有效，`back()` 这类内部调用也仍会经过被包装的 `go()`。时间线的构造函数不是公开入口：调用 `new travels.constructor(...)` 会抛出 `INVALID_OPERATION`，而不会绕过工厂函数的校验。","locale":"zh"},"6022":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过工厂函数创建时间线","content":"如果希望初始状态在编译期就受持久的 JSON 形态状态契约约束、并在运行时立即校验，请使用 `createPatchableTravels()`。","locale":"zh"},"6023":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"用 `createTravels()` 创建的时间线拥有状态，会暴露状态更新方法，但不提供 `recordPatches()`。用 `createTravelJournal()` 创建的时间线，其状态由外部持有，提供 `recordPatches()`、导航与重置，但不提供那些属于状态所有者的更新方法。","locale":"zh"},"6024":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"请从普通 `TravelsOptions` 中移除 `controlledApply`。只与状态相关的方法不再出现在返回的 Journal 对象上，也不会再以“调用即抛错”的方法形式存在。与所有权绑定的选项现在会在运行时直接抛出错误：`apply` 只适用于 Journal 工厂函数，`mutable` 只适用于创建拥有状态的时间线的工厂函数。","locale":"zh"},"6025":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"手动归档能力也遵循同样的规则。只有当工厂函数接收到 `autoArchive: false` 时，`archive()` 与 `canArchive()` 才会存在；自动归档的时间线在运行时与 TypeScript 类型上都不再包含这两个方法，也不再保留一个只会发出警告的 `archive()` 方法。","locale":"zh"},"6026":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"Journal 的泛型现在采用与 `Travels` 相同的 `<S, F, A, P>` 顺序。大多数调用点会自行推断这些类型参数，无需改动。如果 v2 代码把补丁选项作为第三个参数显式传入，则需要在它之前插入归档模式：","locale":"zh"},"6027":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"Controls 类型不再携带自动冻结参数，因为没有任何成员用到它。请删除第二个类型参数：","locale":"zh"},"6028":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#只保留一个状态所有者","content":"`TravelsControls`、`ManualTravelsControls` 与 `RebasableManualTravelsControls` 也是如此。未被使用的辅助类型 `Value` 与 `InitialValue` 已被移除，请直接使用 `S` 或 `ReadonlyState<S>`。","locale":"zh"},"6029":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从可变时间线中移除自动冻结","content":"`createTravels()`、`createPatchableTravels()` 与 `restoreTravels()` 会拒绝同时传入 `enableAutoFreeze: true` 与 `mutable: true`，并抛出 `INVALID_OPTION`。可变模式会就地修改正在使用的状态对象；在 2.x 中，冻结每个产出的状态时，也会一并冻结它与该对象共享的部分，因此后续写入这些部分的更新会抛出 `TypeError`。请从可变时间线中移除 `enableAutoFreeze`：","locale":"zh"},"6030":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从可变时间线中移除自动冻结","content":"当 `enableAutoFreeze` 为字面量 `true` 时，即使 `mutable` 声明为 `boolean` 类型，TypeScript 也会针对这对组合报错。而在运行时计算得出的冻结标志，会在创建时间线时被拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"6031":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将共享视图视为只读","content":"`getHistory()` 现在在实例接口与 `TravelsControls` 控制接口上都返回 `readonly ReadonlyState<S>[]`，因此共享数组及其元素在 TypeScript 中均为只读。`TravelsControls` 的属性与方法均为只读，控制对象在任何构建下都处于冻结状态。观察者事件以借用的 `ReadonlyState<S>` 视图暴露状态，以 `ReadonlyTravelPatches` 暴露补丁；其惰性生成的补丁容器、分组、操作与数组路径同样会被冻结。","locale":"zh"},"6032":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将共享视图视为只读","content":"`controls.patches` 现在是一个带缓存的、已冻结的 `ReadonlyTravelPatches` 视图，而不再在每次读取时重新深拷贝。在历史发生变化之前，它始终保持同一个引用。此前会修改返回对象的代码，必须先通过 `travels.getPatches()` 复制一份。","locale":"zh"},"6033":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将共享视图视为只读","content":"补丁操作的值可能包含嵌套对象，因此观察者仍应把整个事件视为只读。若需要一份与内部状态解耦、归调用方所有的已保留历史快照，请使用 `getPatches()`。","locale":"zh"},"6034":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过单一校验路径恢复","content":"移除不携带状态的 `TravelsHistory` 输入类型，以及 `history`、`initialPatches`、`initialPosition` 与 `strictInitialPatches`。请使用 `Travels.deserialize()` 解码已存储的输入，并原子地恢复完整快照：","locale":"zh"},"6035":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过单一校验路径恢复","content":"格式错误的快照现在会抛出错误，而不再被丢弃。如果确实希望进行容错恢复，请使用 `Travels.deserialize(..., { fallback })`。","locale":"zh"},"6036":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过单一校验路径恢复","content":"独立的 `deserializeTravelsHistory()` 导出与 `Travels.deserialize()` 功能重复，已被移除；请用相同的参数调用 `Travels.deserialize()`。","locale":"zh"},"6037":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过单一校验路径恢复","content":"`restoreTravels()` 会保留 `snapshot.state` 的一份独立副本，绝不会修改原快照或被复用的回退快照。如果可变集成把历史挂到了某个正在使用的可观察 Store 上，就必须把该 Store 指定为恢复目标：","locale":"zh"},"6038":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#通过单一校验路径恢复","content":"Travels 会用快照状态就地覆盖 `target`，因此 Store 不再需要预先填入与恢复后历史一致的数据。","locale":"zh"},"6039":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#升级官方绑定","content":"`use-travel@3` 通过 `createTravels()` 创建由组件拥有的时间线。对于需要恢复的共享时间线，请在 React 之外完成恢复，再把实例传给 `useTravelStore()`：","locale":"zh"},"6040":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#升级官方绑定","content":"`zustand-travel@3` 通过其专属的 `snapshot` 选项恢复一份完整的序列化历史，同时 Zustand 仍是状态所有者。拥有状态的 `Travels` 实例会被有意拒绝。初始化函数依然用于定义 action，快照则提供数据基线：","locale":"zh"},"6041":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#升级官方绑定","content":"`use-travel@3` 要求 `travels@^3.0.0`，而 `zustand-travel@3` 要求 `travels@^3.0.1`；安装 `travels@^3.0.1` 可同时满足两者。请先发布或安装核心包的大版本，再逐个升级绑定。这样能让工厂函数重载、`restoreTravels()` 边界、只读共享视图以及返回的控制对象都遵循同一份带版本号的契约，而不必让它们的行为取决于 peer 依赖的解析结果。","locale":"zh"},"6042":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#导航在单个事件中归档待处理改动","content":"当 `autoArchive` 为 `false` 时，若存在待处理改动，导航会把这些改动作为导航过程的一部分进行归档。2.x 会先发出 `archive` 事件，再发出 `go` 事件；3.0 则先暂存待处理条目，等导航成功后才提交，并且只发出一个 `go` 事件，`getRevision()` 也只前进一次，不可变模式与可变模式都是如此。此前只在 `archive` 事件上做持久化的监听器，应改为在每个提交事件上持久化：","locale":"zh"},"6043":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"Travels 3 将 `mutative@^2.0.0` 作为 peer 依赖。请随 Travels 一同升级：","locale":"zh"},"6044":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"Mutative 2 保留了 Travels 所用的 API，Travels 无需更改任何选项。Mutative 1.x 的补丁无法正确撤销某些更新，例如在一次草稿更新中先缩短又加长的数组，撤销后会留下空洞；又如元素从 `0` 变为 `-0`，撤销后仍为 `-0`。Mutative 2 能记录这两种情况。","locale":"zh"},"6045":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"以下 Mutative 2 的运行时变更会经由 Travels 影响到应用，请检查你的构建：","locale":"zh"},"6046":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"Mutative 2 的构建目标为 ES2018。对于支持 `Proxy` 但不支持 ES2018 语法的引擎，需要转译 `mutative`。","locale":"zh"},"6047":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"Mutative 通过读取 `process.env.NODE_ENV` 来选择开发版或生产版构建。请在每个 bundle 中都定义该变量，包括面向 Node.js 的 bundle。若要在不使用打包器的情况下加载 ES 模块，请把 `mutative` 映射到 `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs`，或用 Travels 的 UMD 构建搭配 Mutative 的 UMD 构建。","locale":"zh"},"6048":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"Mutative 2 的补丁直接以“下一状态”中的对象作为值，而不再存深拷贝。因此在不可变模式下，从 `getState()` 读到的对象同时也是已保留历史的一部分，在 Travels 之外修改它会改变重做时重放的内容。请把状态视为只读，或启用 `enableAutoFreeze` 让这类修改抛出错误。可变模式不受影响，因为它存储的是与状态解耦的补丁值。","locale":"zh"},"6049":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"Mutative 的生产版构建抛出的是 `Minified Mutative error #<code>`，而不是完整错误信息。在生产环境中请匹配错误码，而非错误文本。","locale":"zh"},"6050":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#将-mutative-升级到-2","content":"如果你自己的代码也会调用 Mutative，请查阅其 v1 到 v2 迁移指南。","locale":"zh"},"6051":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#更新观察者与运行时兼容性","content":"订阅者与 devtools 都应使用 `TravelsEvent`。已废弃的 `TravelsDevtoolsEvent` 别名，以及基于监听器参数个数的 `LEGACY_SUBSCRIBER` 警告都已被移除。使用位置参数的监听器必须改写为接收单个事件对象。","locale":"zh"},"6052":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#更新观察者与运行时兼容性","content":"Travels 3 要求 Node.js 22 或更高版本，并已在 Node.js 22 与 24 上测试。","locale":"zh"},"6053":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"Redux-undo 存储完整的状态快照，Travels 存储的是 JSON Patch 条目。","locale":"zh"},"6054":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"保留现有的 reducer 或状态更新函数，作为状态变更的来源。","locale":"zh"},"6055":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"用 reducer 的状态创建一个 Travels 实例。","locale":"zh"},"6056":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"把 `UNDO` / `REDO` 的 dispatch 替换为 `travels.back()` / `travels.forward()`。","locale":"zh"},"6057":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"撤销菜单的文案使用 `metadata` 标签。","locale":"zh"},"6058":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"使用 `travels.serialize()` 进行持久化，而不再存储整个 Redux-undo 历史对象。","locale":"zh"},"6059":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-redux-undo-迁移","content":"对于状态较小、只需短期本地历史的场景，快照栈仍可能更合适。当序列化后的历史体积成为关键因素时，Travels 的优势最为明显。","locale":"zh"},"6060":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"Zundo 直接集成到 Zustand Store 中。你可以把 Travels 当作独立的历史引擎使用：","locale":"zh"},"6061":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"继续用 Zustand 作为 UI Store。","locale":"zh"},"6062":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"在 Store 的 action 中调用 `travels.setState(...)`。","locale":"zh"},"6063":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"在状态变更后，把 `travels.getState()` 同步回 Zustand。","locale":"zh"},"6064":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"需要持久化历史时，使用 `Travels.deserialize(...)` 与 `restoreTravels(...)`。","locale":"zh"},"6065":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-zundo-迁移","content":"参见 `examples/zustand.ts`。","locale":"zh"},"6066":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"`use-travel` 是 React Hook 的封装。当你需要与框架无关的控制能力、持久化适配器、元数据或自定义 Store 集成时，请直接使用 Travels。","locale":"zh"},"6067":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"创建 `const travels = createTravels(initialState)`。","locale":"zh"},"6068":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"使用 `useSyncExternalStore(travels.subscribe, travels.getRevision)` 订阅，并在渲染过程中读取 `travels.getState()`。","locale":"zh"},"6069":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"把 `travels.getControls()` 暴露给组件。","locale":"zh"},"6070":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"页面重新加载时使用 `serialize()` / `Travels.deserialize()`。","locale":"zh"},"6071":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-use-travel-迁移","content":"参见 `examples/react-integration.tsx`。","locale":"zh"},"6072":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从位置参数订阅回调迁移","content":"订阅者现在收到的事件对象与 `devtools` hook 相同，都是 `TravelsEvent`。请用事件解构替换位置参数的回调形参：","locale":"zh"},"6073":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从位置参数订阅回调迁移","content":"对于同一次通知，所有观察者共享同一个浅冻结的事件对象。其 `patches` 属性仍是仅属于该事件的增量，并按需惰性生成；补丁容器、分组、操作与数组路径都会被冻结。顶层元数据在首次访问时被克隆并冻结。嵌套的补丁值与元数据仅属于该事件，但由该事件的所有观察者共享，请将它们视为只读。需要完整的已保留历史时，请调用 `travels.getPatches()`。`TravelsDevtoolsEvent` 在 2.x 中已是废弃别名，3.0 中已被移除。忽略参数的回调（例如外部 Store 的失效通知函数）可以保持不变。","locale":"zh"},"6074":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-mapset-状态迁移","content":"Travels 不再支持在不可变状态或可变状态中使用 Map 或 Set。初始状态与更新会立即失败，恢复的状态或补丁载荷若包含集合，也会在结构校验阶段被拒绝。请在创建或更新 Travels 实例之前先把集合规范化：","locale":"zh"},"6075":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-mapset-状态迁移","content":"对于键不是字符串或键为对象的 Map，请先改用稳定的字符串 ID，再进行转换。应用所需的 Map/Set 视图应保留在 Travels 之外，并由规范化后的状态派生。","locale":"zh"},"6076":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#从-mapset-状态迁移","content":"不要重放由 Map/Set 变更生成的旧补丁历史。这类历史可能包含集合专属的值，或包含非 JSON 的路径定位符，其引用同一性无法可靠迁移。请在 Travels 之外解码旧记录，还原出该记录权威的当前状态，再对该状态做规范化，并建立新的历史基线。持久化编解码器可以在应用领域的集合类型与存储格式之间转换，但传给 Travels 的输出必须仍符合受支持的 JSON 形态契约。","locale":"zh"},"6077":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#持久化迁移","content":"早期手写的持久化通常保存 `{ state, patches, position }`。可以用 `migrate` 转换：","locale":"zh"},"6078":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#持久化迁移","content":"Travels 3 只有一条恢复路径。请把 `Travels.deserialize(...)` 的完整结果传给 `restoreTravels()`；原有的 `history`、`initialPatches`、`initialPosition` 与 `strictInitialPatches` 选项已不存在。格式错误的快照会抛出错误，而不再静默地从空时间线开始。","locale":"zh"},"6079":{"id":"/zh/docs/migration-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/migration#持久化迁移","content":"迁移回调与函数形式的回退回调都必须同步返回。请先完成异步的存储或网络操作，再调用 `Travels.deserialize(...)`；返回 Promise 类结果的回调会以 `MIGRATION_FAILED` 或 `FALLBACK_FAILED` 被拒绝，而且不会留下未处理的 rejection。","locale":"zh"},"6080":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"page","content":"持久化","breadcrumbs":["Travels","持久化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence","locale":"zh"},"6081":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence","content":"序列化、校验、存储、恢复并迁移完整的 Travels 时间线。","locale":"zh"},"6082":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#快照契约","content":"快照契约","locale":"zh"},"6083":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#保存快照","content":"保存快照","locale":"zh"},"6084":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#恢复快照","content":"恢复快照","locale":"zh"},"6085":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#恢复到响应式目标","content":"恢复到响应式目标","locale":"zh"},"6086":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#journal-恢复","content":"Journal 恢复","locale":"zh"},"6087":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#结构校验与语义校验","content":"结构校验与语义校验","locale":"zh"},"6088":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"谨慎选择存储","locale":"zh"},"6089":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence","content":"`serialize()` 返回带版本号的快照，应用负责选择编码与存储方式。使用 **3.0.1** 时，先用 `Travels.deserialize(stored, { validation: 'semantic' })` 校验快照对象或 JSON 字符串，再把结果交给 `restoreTravels()`。下文给出了完整示例。","locale":"zh"},"6090":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence","content":"下一个 3.x 次版本（尚未发布）将支持 `restoreTravels<State>(stored, { validation: 'semantic' })`。在 3.0.1 中，把 `validation` 直接传给恢复工厂会跳过语义校验。","locale":"zh"},"6091":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#快照契约","content":"`TravelsSerializedHistory<S>` 包含以下内容：","locale":"zh"},"6092":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#快照契约","content":"状态、保留的补丁值、补丁路径和元数据都必须满足持久化状态契约。`serialize()` 会克隆返回的状态、补丁和元数据，因此后续编辑不会改写该快照。","locale":"zh"},"6093":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#保存快照","content":"`strict: true` 会拒绝无法按照文档定义的 JSON 契约往返的值。普通的 `serialize()` 不会调用 `JSON.stringify()`、压缩数据，也不会规范化仅存在于运行时的值。当持久化的正确性很重要时，建议显式采用 `strict` 路径。","locale":"zh"},"6094":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#保存快照","content":"为清晰起见，上面的示例在每次事件触发时都会写入。生产应用通常会对写入做防抖、在保存时才序列化、将异步写入排队，并在路由切换或所有者销毁前立即写入。存储适配器指南提供了一个可复用的自动保存模式。","locale":"zh"},"6095":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#恢复快照","content":"`Travels.deserialize()` 接受已解析的对象或 JSON 字符串。它始终执行结构校验；`validation: 'semantic'` 还会在独立的校验副本上检查可达补丁的适用性与可逆性。","locale":"zh"},"6096":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#恢复快照","content":"恢复后的时间线持有快照状态的独立副本。解码后的快照和共享的回退常量，都不会成为运行中的可变状态。","locale":"zh"},"6097":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#恢复到响应式目标","content":"对于 MobX、Vue 或 Pinia，恢复到正在使用的 Store 对象中：","locale":"zh"},"6098":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#恢复到响应式目标","content":"`target` 要求启用可变模式，且根类型必须兼容。Travels 会用快照状态的独立副本就地覆盖目标。","locale":"zh"},"6099":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#journal-恢复","content":"当状态由另一个运行时持有时，用 Journal 的同步 `apply` 回调来恢复：","locale":"zh"},"6100":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#journal-恢复","content":"Travels 会把快照状态和时间线当作一个原子输入整体接收。后续导航中补丁如何提交，仍由所有者决定。","locale":"zh"},"6101":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#结构校验与语义校验","content":"| 模式               | 检查内容               | 适用场景                     |\n| ---------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| `structural`（默认） | 模式、版本、补丁形状、路径、值、位置 | 可信输入，或已经过其他验证边界且对延迟敏感的恢复 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6102":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#结构校验与语义校验","content":"| 模式         | 检查内容               | 适用场景                      |\n| ---------- | ------------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `semantic` | 结构校验，加上正向/反向重放与图隔离 | 未经验证的浏览器存储、导入的文件、可能已损坏的快照 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6103":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#结构校验与语义校验","content":"语义校验的开销随状态结构和可达历史记录增长。它证明的是重放一致性，而不是真实性或来源。参见安全与完整性。","locale":"zh"},"6104":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"仅在快照较小且只需简单的同步保存时使用 **localStorage**。","locale":"zh"},"6105":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"历史记录较大或需要异步存储时，使用 **IndexedDB**、Dexie 或 idb。","locale":"zh"},"6106":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"需要键值 API 与驱动回退时，使用 localForage 或 localspace。","locale":"zh"},"6107":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"按应用和文档为键划分命名空间，例如 `travels:editor:<documentId>`。","locale":"zh"},"6108":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"当快照体积很重要时，在存储前压缩已编码的快照；反序列化前再解压。","locale":"zh"},"6109":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"对重要草稿，保留最近一次已知可用的快照。","locale":"zh"},"6110":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"<Card title=\"存储适配器\" href=\"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters\" description=\"Dexie、idb、localForage、localspace、事务与自动保存。\" />","locale":"zh"},"6111":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"<Card title=\"迁移与恢复\" href=\"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery\" description=\"模式迁移、回退、校验模式与类型化错误。\" />","locale":"zh"},"6112":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence#谨慎选择存储","content":"<Card title=\"安全与完整性\" href=\"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity\" description=\"信任边界、来源、修订号与多设备相关问题。\" />","locale":"zh"},"6113":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"page","content":"迁移与恢复","breadcrumbs":["Travels","持久化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","locale":"zh"},"6114":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","content":"迁移旧版快照、选择校验深度，并在历史记录无效时按预案恢复。","locale":"zh"},"6115":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#迁移旧版快照","content":"迁移旧版快照","locale":"zh"},"6116":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#借助已知安全的回退恢复","content":"借助已知安全的回退恢复","locale":"zh"},"6117":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#匹配重放选项","content":"匹配重放选项","locale":"zh"},"6118":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"解读类型化错误","locale":"zh"},"6119":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"设计恢复流程","locale":"zh"},"6120":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#集合迁移","content":"集合迁移","locale":"zh"},"6121":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#应用模式与-travels-模式","content":"应用模式与 Travels 模式","locale":"zh"},"6122":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","content":"持久化的历史记录属于应用数据，有自己的模式和信任边界。为应用的存储封装加上版本号，在校验前同步完成迁移，并针对每个文档明确“安全恢复”意味着什么。","locale":"zh"},"6123":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#迁移旧版快照","content":"使用 `migrate` 将旧版结构转换为当前的 `TravelsSerializedHistory`，然后再交由 Travels 校验：","locale":"zh"},"6124":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#迁移旧版快照","content":"迁移回调和函数形式的回退回调都是同步的。在调用 `deserialize()` 之前，先读取存储、拉取远程数据、解压字节并验证封装。回调若返回类 Promise 的结果，会以 `MIGRATION_FAILED` 或 `FALLBACK_FAILED` 失败；Travels 会捕获其拒绝，避免出现未处理的 Promise 拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"6125":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#借助已知安全的回退恢复","content":"回退会在检测到解析、迁移或校验失败后运行。回退本身也要经过所选校验模式的检查。回退抛出异常或结果无效时，会报告 `FALLBACK_FAILED`。","locale":"zh"},"6126":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#借助已知安全的回退恢复","content":"如果每次恢复都需要一个全新的对象，使用函数形式的回退；不过恢复过程也会为已接受的快照状态创建独立副本。回退的构建应保持同步。","locale":"zh"},"6127":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#借助已知安全的回退恢复","content":"一段在内部可逆、但未经授权或并非预期的替代历史记录，仍是有效输入，不会触发回退。当这些属性很重要时，应在反序列化之前，在 Travels 之外验证签名、修订号、文档标识或校验和。","locale":"zh"},"6128":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#匹配重放选项","content":"如果录制历史记录时使用了自定义的 Mutative `strict` 或 `mark` 行为，在语义校验时提供相同的设置：","locale":"zh"},"6129":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#匹配重放选项","content":"语义重放不会启用可变重放或自动冻结；这些输出策略不会改变补丁的解释方式。自动冻结应改为在恢复后的实例上配置。反序列化不会冻结或修改调用方拥有的快照对象。","locale":"zh"},"6130":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"`PARSE_ERROR`：输入不是有效的 JSON。","locale":"zh"},"6131":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"`UNSUPPORTED_VERSION`：显式迁移该模式，或明确拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"6132":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"`INVALID_SCHEMA`：快照字段、元数据或游标格式有误。","locale":"zh"},"6133":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"`INVALID_PATCHES`：补丁形状、操作、路径或值无效。","locale":"zh"},"6134":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"`INVALID_HISTORY`：可达条目无法一致地重放和反向应用。","locale":"zh"},"6135":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"`MIGRATION_FAILED` / `FALLBACK_FAILED`：检查回调边界和 `cause`。","locale":"zh"},"6136":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#解读类型化错误","content":"结构校验不会应用补丁，因此无法发现所有重放失败。对于未经验证的存储，语义校验就是损坏检测的边界。","locale":"zh"},"6137":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"对于重要的离线文档：","locale":"zh"},"6138":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"读取存储中的原始字节以及上一份已验证的快照。","locale":"zh"},"6139":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"验证应用层封装、租户/文档标识以及单调递增的修订号。","locale":"zh"},"6140":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"在 Travels 之外解码或解压。","locale":"zh"},"6141":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"迁移到当前快照模式。","locale":"zh"},"6142":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"对未经验证的输入执行语义校验。","locale":"zh"},"6143":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"恢复到独立状态或显式的可变目标。","locale":"zh"},"6144":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"如果任一步骤失败，恢复受信任的默认值或最近一次已知可用的快照，并报告稳定错误码。","locale":"zh"},"6145":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#设计恢复流程","content":"在隐私政策允许时保留有问题的载荷以供诊断；在用户或支持流程能够检查之前，不要立即用空白快照覆盖它。","locale":"zh"},"6146":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#集合迁移","content":"在规范化当前状态后，不要重放旧的 Map/Set 专用补丁历史。基于引用的集合路径和值无法作为通用 JSON Patch 可靠迁移。在 Travels 之外重建权威的当前状态，将其转换为受支持的普通对象和稠密数组，然后创建新的历史记录基线。","locale":"zh"},"6147":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/migration-and-recovery#应用模式与-travels-模式","content":"`TRAVELS_HISTORY_SCHEMA_VERSION` 表示历史记录封装的版本，而不是文档业务字段的版本。当需要迁移文档时，在外层存储记录中单独保留一个应用模式版本，并在创建或恢复 Travels 状态之前完成这些迁移。","locale":"zh"},"6148":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"page","content":"安全与完整性","breadcrumbs":["Travels","持久化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","locale":"zh"},"6149":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","content":"理解语义校验能证明什么，以及身份认证、修订号和冲突处理应放在哪里。","locale":"zh"},"6150":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#先验证再反序列化","content":"先验证，再反序列化","locale":"zh"},"6151":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"按信任模型选择控制措施","locale":"zh"},"6152":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#快照与原型安全","content":"快照与原型安全","locale":"zh"},"6153":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"多设备与协作编辑","locale":"zh"},"6154":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#保护可用性","content":"保护可用性","locale":"zh"},"6155":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#报告漏洞","content":"报告漏洞","locale":"zh"},"6156":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","content":"`Travels.deserialize({ validation: 'semantic' })` 证明的是：存储的锚点和可达的补丁条目能够在隔离的图上一致地重放和反向应用。它**不能**证明快照由谁写入、是否为最新快照，也不能证明重建出的过去就是最初记录的那段历史。","locale":"zh"},"6157":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#先验证再反序列化","content":"如果外部验证失败，丢弃未经验证的快照，并选择受信任的默认值或最近一次已知可用的快照。不要指望 `fallback` 能发现内部一致但未经授权的历史记录。","locale":"zh"},"6158":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"| 场景         | 宿主应用的职责        |\n| ---------- | -------------- |\n| 短暂的本地撤销/重做 | 重放校验和安全回退通常就够了 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6159":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"| 场景      | 宿主应用的职责                           |\n| ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 重要的离线草稿 | 对原始字节计算校验和，维护单调递增的修订号，保留上一份已验证的快照 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6160":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"| 场景    | 宿主应用的职责                              |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 多设备同步 | 将租户/用户/文档标识绑定到由服务端控制的修订号，并处理过期或冲突的快照 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6161":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"| 场景    | 宿主应用的职责                  |\n| ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 防篡改存储 | 验证由服务端持有的 HMAC、签名或认证加密标签 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6162":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"| 场景      | 宿主应用的职责                              |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 审计级历史记录 | 使用以服务端为权威的仅追加事件日志，以及可信的链头或等效的密码学承诺机制 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6163":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#按信任模型选择控制措施","content":"校验和能发现意外损坏，但不能认证写入者。与攻击者控制的浏览器数据放在一起的密钥，无法建立信任。位于同一个可变数据块内的哈希链和检查点，也可能连同该数据块一起被改写。","locale":"zh"},"6164":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#快照与原型安全","content":"对象形式的快照字段和补丁容器字段必须是自有数据属性。访问器和继承字段会被直接拒绝，不会被求值。补丁组、数组路径和元数据列表必须是普通的稠密数组，不能带有自定义原型或自有属性；校验使用按索引的数据属性访问，而不是输入自行定义的数组方法。","locale":"zh"},"6165":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#快照与原型安全","content":"这些规则减少了解码过程中由输入决定的行为。仍应把导入的快照视为不可信的应用数据：在存储边界限制载荷大小和历史记录长度，并避免把敏感的文档内容写入日志。","locale":"zh"},"6166":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"Travels 不是 CRDT 或操作转换系统，不会合并并发历史记录，也不会解决冲突编辑。同步层必须明确以下事项：","locale":"zh"},"6167":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"权威的文档标识与租户标识；","locale":"zh"},"6168":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"排序规则与单调递增的修订号；","locale":"zh"},"6169":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"过期快照的拒绝策略；","locale":"zh"},"6170":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"冲突检测与解决；","locale":"zh"},"6171":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"远程快照是替换、变基（rebase），还是开启一条新的本地时间线；","locale":"zh"},"6172":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"本地状态提交后远程保存失败时的重试行为。","locale":"zh"},"6173":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#多设备与协作编辑","content":"如果在接受权威远程状态时不保留本地历史记录，使用 `replaceStateWithoutHistory()` 或恢复一份经过校验的快照。如果确实要保留本地会话但清除旧历史记录，再使用 `rebase()`。","locale":"zh"},"6174":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#保护可用性","content":"语义重放的开销随状态结构和可达历史记录增长。在校验未经验证的上传内容或同步载荷之前，对编码字节数、条目数量、嵌套深度和可接受的文档类型实施应用层限制。只有在经过受信任的验证边界之后，或者明确认为仅需模式校验时，才使用结构校验。","locale":"zh"},"6175":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#保护可用性","content":"可变导航可能保留重放失败之前已经发生的写入。因此，对未经验证的历史记录而言，恢复前执行语义校验既是正确性保障，也是可用性保障。","locale":"zh"},"6176":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/security-and-integrity#报告漏洞","content":"如需报告 Travels 库的漏洞，遵循项目的安全策略。请勿在公开 issue 中包含真实的用户文档、机密信息或私有持久化载荷。","locale":"zh"},"6177":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"page","content":"存储适配器","breadcrumbs":["Travels","持久化"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","locale":"zh"},"6178":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"面向生产环境的 Dexie、idb、localForage 与 localspace 持久化适配器。","locale":"zh"},"6179":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#快照契约","content":"快照契约","locale":"zh"},"6180":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#自动保存模式","content":"自动保存模式","locale":"zh"},"6181":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"Dexie.js","locale":"zh"},"6182":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"idb","locale":"zh"},"6183":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"localForage","locale":"zh"},"6184":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"localspace","locale":"zh"},"6185":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"选择适配器","locale":"zh"},"6186":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#迁移与损坏恢复","content":"迁移与损坏恢复","locale":"zh"},"6187":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"完整性与来源","locale":"zh"},"6188":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"外部参考","locale":"zh"},"6189":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"Travels 的持久化不依赖具体存储。唯一需要存储的值，就是 `travels.serialize()` 返回的带版本号快照。用 `Travels.deserialize(...)` 恢复它，再把校验后的快照传给 `restoreTravels(...)`。","locale":"zh"},"6190":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"本指南针对以下库展示面向生产环境的适配器：","locale":"zh"},"6191":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"Dexie.js","locale":"zh"},"6192":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"idb","locale":"zh"},"6193":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"localForage","locale":"zh"},"6194":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"localspace","locale":"zh"},"6195":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"以下 API 说明已于 2026-05-15 对照最新文档和 npm 包元数据核对：","locale":"zh"},"6196":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"| 库        | 核对的包版本        | 存储模型                   | 适用场景                 |\n| -------- | ------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------- |\n| Dexie.js | `dexie@4.4.2` | IndexedDB 表、索引、事务、复杂查询 | 多文档、可搜索的快照目录、自定义清理查询 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6197":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"| 库   | 核对的包版本      | 存储模型                          | 适用场景                      |\n| --- | ----------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| idb | `idb@8.0.3` | 原生 IndexedDB 之上的轻量 Promise 封装 | 需要显式模式控制的小型 IndexedDB 适配器 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6198":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"| 库           | 核对的包版本               | 存储模型                                                         | 适用场景               |\n| ----------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| localForage | `localforage@1.10.0` | 基于 IndexedDB 和 localStorage 的异步键值 API，并提供面向旧浏览器的遗留 WebSQL 驱动 | 简单浏览器键值持久化，兼顾遗留兼容性 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6199":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"| 库          | 核对的包版本             | 存储模型                                                               | 适用场景                                      |\n| ---------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| localspace | `localspace@1.2.0` | 兼容 localForage 的异步键值 API，提供 IndexedDB/localStorage 驱动、批量 API、事务和插件 | TypeScript 优先的键值持久化、批处理，以及插件驱动的 TTL/压缩/加密 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6200":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","content":"Playwright 端到端测试套件会在真实的浏览器存储实现上检验这些适配器模式。它还会植入结构有效但无法重放的历史记录，以验证语义校验和回退恢复。测试夹具使用测试专用的数据库名，但保存、加载、事务和清理的语义与下面的示例保持一致。","locale":"zh"},"6201":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#快照契约","content":"把序列化后的完整快照作为单条存储记录。它包含状态、补丁历史记录、当前位置、可选的元数据以及 Travels 模式版本。","locale":"zh"},"6202":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#快照契约","content":"为了实现可靠的持久化，状态、保留的补丁值和历史记录元数据必须使用普通对象、稠密数组、字符串、除 `-0` 之外的有限数字、布尔值和 `null`。路径必须是 Travels 接受的 JSON Pointer 字符串，或由字符串或有限非负整数组成的稠密数组；其他值都是无效的路径段。对 `bigint` 进行编码；`NaN`、无穷大和 `-0` 需要规范化，因为 JSON 会拒绝或改变它们。数组空洞以及自定义属性/原型不会被快照或 JSON/JSON Patch 保留；用 `null` 填充空洞，并使用普通数组和对象。即使 IndexedDB 或其他适配器能够存储 Map 和 Set，它们作为 Travels 状态和保留的补丁载荷仍会被拒绝。旧历史记录中仅存在于运行时的值或路径，仍会保留在存储记录中。","locale":"zh"},"6203":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#快照契约","content":"下面的适配器示例会复用本节中的 `DocumentState`、`restoreDocument(...)` 和 `attachAutoSave(...)` 定义。","locale":"zh"},"6204":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#自动保存模式","content":"存储写入通常应做防抖。这样快速编辑时不会每按一次键就写入一个快照，同时仍会持久化 Travels 最新已提交的状态。","locale":"zh"},"6205":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#自动保存模式","content":"在路由切换或其他由应用控制的关闭时机之前，调用 `flush()`。Travels 实例不再活跃时使用 `dispose()`；它会清除所有待处理的防抖任务、移除订阅，并默认写入最新快照。","locale":"zh"},"6206":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#自动保存模式","content":"如果编辑内容必须在关闭标签页后仍然保留，还要在页面生命周期处理器中调用 `travels.serialize()`，尽力执行最后一次保存；如果页面仍处于活跃状态，也可以调用返回的 `flush()` 方法。这条路径应尽量精简：浏览器关闭事件并不可靠，不适合执行长时间的异步工作。","locale":"zh"},"6207":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"Dexie.js 是 IndexedDB 的高层封装，提供表 API、模式版本管理、索引、事务和批量操作。当应用需要保存许多条持久化时间线，并按文档、时间戳、所有者或项目查询时，它很合适。","locale":"zh"},"6208":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"安装：","locale":"zh"},"6209":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"适配器：","locale":"zh"},"6210":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"当一次用户操作同时更新快照和一张关联表时，使用事务：","locale":"zh"},"6211":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"清理旧快照记录时，使用 `updatedAt` 索引：","locale":"zh"},"6212":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"Dexie 专属说明：","locale":"zh"},"6213":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"使用 `version(...).stores(...)` 进行模式演进。","locale":"zh"},"6214":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"需要原子恢复时，将序列化后的 Travels 快照保存在同一行记录中。","locale":"zh"},"6215":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"只为实际查询的值添加二级索引，例如 `updatedAt`。","locale":"zh"},"6216":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#dexiejs","content":"当持久化属于更大范围的 IndexedDB 数据模型，而不只是一条键值记录时，优先选择 Dexie。","locale":"zh"},"6217":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"`idb` 是一个轻量的 Promise 封装，接口基本与原生 IndexedDB 一致。当你需要 IndexedDB 的对象存储、索引和事务语义，又不想引入更重的抽象时，它很合适。","locale":"zh"},"6218":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"安装：","locale":"zh"},"6219":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"适配器：","locale":"zh"},"6220":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"idb 专属说明：","locale":"zh"},"6221":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"`openDB(name, version, { upgrade })` 是创建或迁移对象存储与索引的地方。","locale":"zh"},"6222":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"针对单存储操作，可使用 `db.get(...)`、`db.put(...)`、`db.delete(...)` 和 `db.clear(...)` 这些快捷方法。","locale":"zh"},"6223":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"一次保存包含多个操作时，使用显式事务并 `await tx.done`。","locale":"zh"},"6224":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#idb","content":"不要在活跃的 IndexedDB 事务中间等待无关的异步工作，例如 `fetch(...)`。等待期间事务可能会自动关闭。","locale":"zh"},"6225":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"localForage 提供类似 `localStorage` 的异步 API，包括 `getItem`、`setItem`、`removeItem`、`clear`、`keys` 和 `iterate`。文档给出的默认驱动顺序是 IndexedDB、WebSQL、localStorage，但 WebSQL 在现代浏览器中已被废弃。将 WebSQL 视为遗留迁移场景，并围绕 IndexedDB 设计新的持久化。","locale":"zh"},"6226":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"安装：","locale":"zh"},"6227":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"适配器：","locale":"zh"},"6228":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"localForage 专属说明：","locale":"zh"},"6229":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"在任何数据 API 调用之前调用 `config(...)`，或者优先使用 `createInstance(...)` 创建隔离的存储。","locale":"zh"},"6230":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"`setItem(...)` 返回已保存的值；键不存在时 `getItem(...)` 返回 `null`。","locale":"zh"},"6231":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"`undefined` 不是可持久化的存储值；如果要有意表示空值，使用 `null`。","locale":"zh"},"6232":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"`clear()` 会删除当前存储中的全部内容。要删除单个 Travels 快照，使用 `removeItem(key)`。","locale":"zh"},"6233":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localforage","content":"localForage 是简单的键值适配器。如果需要原子的多键写入，直接使用 IndexedDB、Dexie.js、idb，或使用以 IndexedDB 为活动驱动的 localspace。","locale":"zh"},"6234":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"localspace 保留了 localForage 风格的存储方法，同时加入 TypeScript 优先的 API、批量操作、事务辅助工具、插件和显式指定的现代驱动。它在浏览器中支持 IndexedDB 和 localStorage，不支持 WebSQL。内存驱动只有在显式添加为回退时才可用，且重新加载后会丢失数据。","locale":"zh"},"6235":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"安装：","locale":"zh"},"6236":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"适配器：","locale":"zh"},"6237":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"需要同时保存关联记录时，使用 `runTransaction(...)` 或批量 API。在 IndexedDB 驱动下，这具备事务性；localStorage 回退会依次执行这些操作，但无法提供 IndexedDB 风格的原子提交：","locale":"zh"},"6238":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"如需处理多条时间线：","locale":"zh"},"6239":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"localspace 专属说明：","locale":"zh"},"6240":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"需要可靠的浏览器回退时，优先使用 `[localspace.INDEXEDDB, localspace.LOCALSTORAGE]`。","locale":"zh"},"6241":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"只有在可以接受仅运行时回退时，才添加 `localspace.MEMORY`。","locale":"zh"},"6242":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"批量场景下，使用 `setItems(...)`、`getItems(...)` 和 `removeItems(...)`。在 localStorage 回退下，批量操作不是原子的。","locale":"zh"},"6243":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"仅对突发性的多键写入使用 `coalesceWrites`。对于单个经过防抖的 `SNAPSHOT_KEY`，通常没有必要。","locale":"zh"},"6244":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"使用加密时，设置 `pluginErrorPolicy: 'strict'`，以免持久化错误被吞掉。","locale":"zh"},"6245":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#localspace","content":"销毁插件较多的实例时，调用 `destroy()`。","locale":"zh"},"6246":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"| 需求                | 推荐适配器                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 每个应用一个快照，API 尽量精简 | localForage 或 localspace |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6247":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"| 需求                          | 推荐适配器 |\n| --------------------------- | ----- |\n| 每个应用一个快照，需要严格的 IndexedDB 语义 | idb   |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6248":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"| 需求          | 推荐适配器    |\n| ----------- | -------- |\n| 多文档、索引、清理查询 | Dexie.js |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6249":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"| 需求                          | 推荐适配器      |\n| --------------------------- | ---------- |\n| 批量写入，以及兼容 localForage 的迁移路径 | localspace |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6250":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"| 需求                 | 推荐适配器                                                   |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 已有 localForage 代码库 | 优先 localForage；在采用 TypeScript 优先 API 或批处理时改用 localspace |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6251":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#选择适配器","content":"| 需求                     | 推荐适配器                     |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 避免 WebSQL，并显式指定现代浏览器驱动 | localspace、idb 或 Dexie.js |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6252":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#迁移与损坏恢复","content":"当存储的结构早于 Travels 当前的序列化历史记录模式时，使用 `migrate`：","locale":"zh"},"6253":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#迁移与损坏恢复","content":"`migrate` 和函数形式的 `fallback` 都是同步回调。在调用 `Travels.deserialize(...)` 之前，先等待存储、网络或其他异步工作完成。回调若返回类 Promise 的结果，会以 `MIGRATION_FAILED` 或 `FALLBACK_FAILED` 失败，Travels 会捕获其拒绝，以防出现未处理的 Promise 拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"6254":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"`Travels.deserialize(...)` 始终验证快照的结构有效性。启用 `validation: 'semantic'` 时，它还会在独立的校验副本上验证历史记录能否在正反两个方向上一致重放，同时不让重放修改传入的状态或补丁值。两种模式都不能证明快照来自何处，也不能证明重建出的过去就是最初记录的那段历史。版本 1 没有独立且可信的历史锚点，因此内部可逆的替代历史记录会被接受，且不会触发 `fallback`。这一边界由 `test/persistence-semantics.test.ts` 覆盖。","locale":"zh"},"6255":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"对于对象形式的输入，顶层快照字段以及补丁容器的 `patches` 和 `inversePatches` 字段必须是自有数据属性。访问器和继承字段会被直接拒绝，不会被求值；被接受的字段只会读取一次。补丁历史记录容器、补丁组、数组路径和元数据列表必须是普通的稠密数组，不能带有自定义的自有属性或原型。冻结的普通数组是有效的。校验过程和历史记录克隆过程都使用按索引的数据属性访问，而不是输入自行定义的数组方法，因此格式错误的数组会通过稳定的持久化错误码被拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"6256":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"当完整性或来源很重要时，验证**必须**在 Travels 之外进行，并且要在反序列化之前完成：","locale":"zh"},"6257":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-79","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"如果外部验证失败，丢弃未经验证的快照，并恢复受信任的默认值或最近一次已知可用的快照。不要依赖 `fallback` 去发现内部一致的替代历史记录。","locale":"zh"},"6258":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-80","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"结构校验是默认选项，以保持同步 API 的低延迟行为。它会拒绝格式错误的模式和补丁编码，但不能证明导航一定能够成功应用。对于未经验证或可能已损坏的存储，显式使用语义校验：","locale":"zh"},"6259":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-81","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"语义重放会在恢复后的历史记录投入使用之前，发现适用性和可逆性失败。其开销会随可达历史记录增长，也会随每个补丁复制的容器数量增加。如果快照已经由受信任的应用边界完成认证或以其他方式验证，那么在恢复延迟很重要时，可以使用默认的结构校验路径。","locale":"zh"},"6260":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-82","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"根据应用的信任模型选择完整性机制：","locale":"zh"},"6261":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-83","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"| 场景           | 宿主应用的职责                       |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| 短暂的 UI 撤销/重做 | Travels 的重放校验加上已知安全的回退通常就足够了。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6262":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-84","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"| 场景      | 宿主应用的职责                                                        |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 重要的离线草稿 | 对编码后的字节本身计算校验和，保存单调递增的修订号，并至少保留一份此前已验证的快照。校验和能发现意外损坏，但不能认证写入者。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6263":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-85","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"| 场景    | 宿主应用的职责                                      |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 多设备同步 | 将文档和租户/用户标识绑定到由服务端控制的修订号，并在反序列化之前处理过期或冲突的快照。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6264":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-86","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"| 场景    | 宿主应用的职责                                                |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 防篡改存储 | 验证由服务端持有的 HMAC、数字签名或认证加密标签。与攻击者控制的浏览器数据放在一起的密钥，无法建立信任。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6265":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-87","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"| 场景      | 宿主应用的职责                                                         |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 审计级历史记录 | 维护以服务端为权威的仅追加事件日志，以及可信的签名链头或等效的密码学承诺机制。把 Travels 快照视为可重建的客户端缓存。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6266":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-88","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"对每个补丁计算哈希、存储额外的检查点，或在同一个可变数据块中嵌入哈希链，都会增加冗余，但本身无法证明历史的原始意图；能够改写该数据块的攻击者，同样可以改写这些值。受信任的校验和、签名、修订号或链承诺，必须由其保护的快照之外的一方掌管。","locale":"zh"},"6267":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-89","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"恢复规则：","locale":"zh"},"6268":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-90","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"始终应为浏览器启动路径提供 `fallback`。它能从检测到的解析、迁移和校验失败中恢复；外部完整性失败则必须在反序列化之前选定受信任的快照。","locale":"zh"},"6269":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-91","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"对未经验证的快照选择 `validation: 'semantic'`。只有在模式校验已经足够，或受信任的应用边界已经验证过快照时，才使用默认的结构校验模式。","locale":"zh"},"6270":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-92","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"使用 `onError` 记录稳定的 `TravelsPersistenceError.code`；针对具体条目的 `INVALID_HISTORY` 重放失败还会标出出错的 `entryIndex` 和重放 `direction`，而整图隔离失败会省略无法如实归因的字段。","locale":"zh"},"6271":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-93","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"如果录制时使用了自定义的 Mutative `strict` 或 `mark` 设置，通过 `replayOptions` 传入相同的值，使语义校验采用完全一致的重放规则。","locale":"zh"},"6272":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-94","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"在应用边界规范化 Map、Set、内置子类、自定义自有属性、访问器、不可枚举数据、自定义数组原型和非零的 `RegExp.lastIndex` 值；语义比较会将这类结构视为无法验证并拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"6273":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-95","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"在恢复后的 Travels 实例上配置 `enableAutoFreeze`；反序列化会有意避免冻结调用方拥有的快照对象。","locale":"zh"},"6274":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-96","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"为存储键保留命名空间，例如 `travels:<app>:<documentId>`。","locale":"zh"},"6275":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-97","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"如果持久化数据的体积是重要考量，在存储前压缩序列化后的快照，并在 `Travels.deserialize(...)` 之前解压。","locale":"zh"},"6276":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-98","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#完整性与来源","content":"如果应用数据包含 `bigint`、Date、Map 或 Set 值，在创建或更新 Travels 状态之前对其进行规范化。持久化编解码器可以在 Travels 之外恢复应用领域的集合，但传给 `createTravels(...)` 的状态必须仍是有限数字、时间戳、记录、稠密数组和其他受支持的 JSON 形态值。","locale":"zh"},"6277":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-99","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"Dexie.js 文档：https://dexie.org/docs/index","locale":"zh"},"6278":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-100","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"Dexie.js API 参考：https://dexie.org/docs/API-Reference","locale":"zh"},"6279":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-101","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"idb README 与 API：https://github.com/jakearchibald/idb#readme","locale":"zh"},"6280":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-102","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"localForage README：https://github.com/localForage/localForage#readme","locale":"zh"},"6281":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-103","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"localForage API 文档：https://github.com/localForage/localForage/blob/master/docs/api.md","locale":"zh"},"6282":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-104","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"localspace README：https://github.com/unadlib/localspace#readme","locale":"zh"},"6283":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-105","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"localspace API 参考：https://github.com/unadlib/localspace/blob/main/docs/api-reference.md","locale":"zh"},"6284":{"id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters-106","page_id":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/persistence/storage-adapters#外部参考","content":"Chrome Web SQL 弃用时间线：https://developer.chrome.com/blog/web-sql-deprecation-timeline-updated","locale":"zh"},"6285":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"page","content":"兼容性策略","breadcrumbs":["Travels","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","locale":"zh"},"6286":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","content":"受支持的运行时、浏览器、状态形状、官方绑定与版本管理。","locale":"zh"},"6287":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"运行时支持","locale":"zh"},"6288":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#浏览器支持","content":"浏览器支持","locale":"zh"},"6289":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#peer-依赖","content":"peer 依赖","locale":"zh"},"6290":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#官方绑定","content":"官方绑定","locale":"zh"},"6291":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#状态兼容性","content":"状态兼容性","locale":"zh"},"6292":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#版本管理","content":"版本管理","locale":"zh"},"6293":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"Travels 在以下环境经过测试：","locale":"zh"},"6294":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"Node.js 22.x","locale":"zh"},"6295":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"Node.js 24.x","locale":"zh"},"6296":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"通过 Vitest 运行、类似浏览器的 jsdom 环境","locale":"zh"},"6297":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"通过 Playwright 集成测试覆盖 Chromium、Firefox 和 WebKit","locale":"zh"},"6298":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#运行时支持","content":"Node.js 22 是最低支持的运行时版本。该包以 ESM、CJS、UMD 与 TypeScript 声明文件的形式分发。","locale":"zh"},"6299":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#浏览器支持","content":"Travels 面向支持所需标准 JavaScript 与 JSON API 的现代浏览器。持久化示例会在环境支持时使用 `localStorage`、IndexedDB 与 BroadcastChannel。","locale":"zh"},"6300":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#浏览器支持","content":"Mutative 2 的构建以 ES2018 为目标，并通过 `process.env.NODE_ENV` 选择开发版或生产版构建。会定义 `NODE_ENV` 的打包器能同时处理两种构建。不使用打包器时，请加载 `mutative/dist/mutative.esm.production.min.mjs` 或 Mutative 的 UMD 构建，因为 Mutative 默认的 ES 模块需要 `process` 全局变量。","locale":"zh"},"6301":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#peer-依赖","content":"`mutative` 是 peer 依赖，支持 `^2.0.0`。不支持 Mutative 1.x，因为其部分补丁无法撤销它们记录的变更。测试套件针对仓库固定的开发版本运行。","locale":"zh"},"6302":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#官方绑定","content":"v3 官方绑定使用公开的工厂能力，而不是内部构造函数：","locale":"zh"},"6303":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#官方绑定","content":"| 绑定           | 绑定版本  | 支持的 Travels 版本 | 恢复历史记录的交接方式                                    |\n| ------------ | ----- | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `use-travel` | `3.x` | `^3.0.0`       | `restoreTravels(snapshot)`，然后 `useTravelStore` |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6304":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#官方绑定","content":"| 绑定               | 绑定版本  | 支持的 Travels 版本 | 恢复历史记录的交接方式                         |\n| ---------------- | ----- | -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `zustand-travel` | `3.x` | `^3.0.1`       | `travel(initializer, { snapshot })` |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6305":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#官方绑定","content":"每个绑定的主版本都声明与 Travels 相同的 `mutative` peer 范围（`^2.0.0`），因此三个包可以一起安装而不会产生 peer 冲突。各绑定的主版本要求 Travels 3，从而让工厂重载、原子恢复路径、只读共享视图与控制能力共享同一份稳定契约。先发布并安装核心包的主版本，再基于该已发布产物验证并发布每个绑定的主版本。由绑定拥有的时间线仍为不可变模式，并且绑定会拒绝已移除或不兼容的所有权选项，而不是静默丢弃它们。","locale":"zh"},"6306":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#状态兼容性","content":"状态、保留的补丁值与历史记录元数据若由普通对象、稠密数组、字符串、除 `-0` 之外的有限数字、布尔值与 `null` 构成，则受支持。路径必须是 Travels 可接受的 JSON Pointer 字符串，或由字符串与有限非负整数组成的稠密数组；其他值都是无效的路径段。对象形式的快照字段与补丁容器字段必须是自有数据属性；访问器与继承字段会被拒绝，且不会对它们求值。恢复的历史记录容器、补丁组、数组路径与元数据列表，必须是不含自定义自有属性或自定义原型的普通稠密数组；冻结的普通数组可以接受。`bigint` 会让 `JSON.stringify` 抛出异常；`NaN` 与无穷大会变成 `null`，而 `-0` 会变成 `0`。请在应用边界处规范化这些值。数组空洞、自定义属性以及自定义或 `null` 原型，都无法在补丁重放与 JSON 持久化后保留下来；请用 `null` 填充空洞，并使用普通数组与对象。Mutative 默认不会为 `null` 原型状态字典创建草稿，因此嵌套写入可能无法生成可撤销的补丁。即使不兼容的值或路径只保留在较旧的补丁中，也仍会使快照不安全。","locale":"zh"},"6307":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#状态兼容性","content":"不可变与可变两种运行时模式都会拒绝 Map 与 Set。Travels 会在提交更新前检查初始状态与新生成的补丁载荷；结构校验下的恢复也会拒绝状态或保留补丁中的集合类型。在传给 Travels 之前，请把 Map 条目转换为普通记录或稠密条目数组，把 Set 值转换为稠密数组；持久化编解码器必须生成这些受支持的形状，而不能把集合解码回 Travels 状态。","locale":"zh"},"6308":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#版本管理","content":"Travels 遵循 semver：","locale":"zh"},"6309":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#版本管理","content":"补丁版本修复缺陷，不会有意更改 API。","locale":"zh"},"6310":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#版本管理","content":"次版本可以新增 API 与警告，同时保持现有行为不变。","locale":"zh"},"6311":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#版本管理","content":"主版本可能更改公共 API、持久化模式语义或运行时支持。","locale":"zh"},"6312":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/compatibility#版本管理","content":"持久化的历史记录快照包含模式版本。升级存储格式时，使用 `Travels.deserialize(..., { migrate })`。","locale":"zh"},"6313":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"page","content":"实例方法","breadcrumbs":["Travels","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","locale":"zh"},"6314":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","content":"按任务组织的索引，涵盖时间线、Journal、导航、历史记录与持久化方法。","locale":"zh"},"6315":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#状态与修订号","content":"状态与修订号","locale":"zh"},"6316":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"更新与分组","locale":"zh"},"6317":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"导航","locale":"zh"},"6318":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#基线与追踪","content":"基线与追踪","locale":"zh"},"6319":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"历史记录读取","locale":"zh"},"6320":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#持久化","content":"持久化","locale":"zh"},"6321":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#校验辅助函数","content":"校验辅助函数","locale":"zh"},"6322":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#订阅","content":"订阅","locale":"zh"},"6323":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","content":"本页按任务对公开方法分组。确切的泛型、重载、返回对象与带源码链接的签名，见生成的 API 参考。","locale":"zh"},"6324":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#状态与修订号","content":"| 方法           | 返回值 | 说明            |\n| ------------ | --- | ------------- |\n| `getState()` | `S` | 当前实时状态；应视为只读。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6325":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#状态与修订号","content":"| 方法              | 返回值      | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | -------- | ------------------- |\n| `getRevision()` | `number` | 每次已提交事件递增的 O(1) 令牌。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6326":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#状态与修订号","content":"| 方法        | 返回值       | 说明                |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------- |\n| `mutable` | `boolean` | 拥有状态的时间线是否使用可变模式。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6327":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#状态与修订号","content":"| 方法                 | 返回值  | 说明                            |\n| ------------------ | ---- | ----------------------------- |\n| `isTravels(value)` | 类型守卫 | 识别由当前这份 Travels 副本创建的拥有状态时间线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6328":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"| 方法                             | 可用范围     | 用途                |\n| ------------------------------ | -------- | ----------------- |\n| `setState(updater, metadata?)` | 拥有状态的时间线 | 提交直接值、返回的状态或草稿函数。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6329":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"| 方法                           | 可用范围     | 用途                     |\n| ---------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `transaction(metadata?, fn)` | 拥有状态的时间线 | 以原子方式对同步操作分组；只产生一个根事件。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6330":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"| 方法                     | 可用范围     | 用途                   |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `batch(metadata?, fn)` | 拥有状态的时间线 | `transaction()` 的别名。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6331":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"| 方法                            | 可用范围    | 用途                    |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| `recordPatches(state, entry)` | Journal | 记录外部所有者给出的精确正向/反向补丁对。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6332":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"| 方法                   | 可用范围          | 用途               |\n| -------------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| `archive(metadata?)` | 手动时间线/Journal | 把待处理的更新作为一个条目提交。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6333":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"| 方法             | 可用范围          | 用途           |\n| -------------- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| `canArchive()` | 手动时间线/Journal | 检查是否有待处理的工作。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6334":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#更新与分组","content":"更新函数与事务回调必须是同步的。Journal 不暴露 `setState()`、事务、追踪控制或 `getControls()`。","locale":"zh"},"6335":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"| 方法              | 用途            |\n| --------------- | ------------- |\n| `back(amount?)` | 撤销一个或多个保留的条目。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6336":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"| 方法                 | 用途            |\n| ------------------ | ------------- |\n| `forward(amount?)` | 重做一个或多个保留的条目。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6337":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"| 方法             | 用途          |\n| -------------- | ----------- |\n| `go(position)` | 跳转到保留的游标位置。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6338":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"| 方法                           | 用途        |\n| ---------------------------- | --------- |\n| `canBack()` / `canForward()` | 检查是否可以导航。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6339":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"| 方法              | 用途      |\n| --------------- | ------- |\n| `getPosition()` | 读取当前游标。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6340":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"| 方法        | 用途              |\n| --------- | --------------- |\n| `reset()` | 通过所有者恢复实例的现有基线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6341":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#导航","content":"导航会发布 `go` 事件。手动模式下待处理的工作会作为成功导航的一部分被归档。Journal 通过 `apply` 委托应用补丁，并且不得把该导航再次记录为新的外部编辑。","locale":"zh"},"6342":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#基线与追踪","content":"| 方法         | 用途                      |\n| ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| `rebase()` | 保留当前状态，并丢弃全部过去与未来的历史记录。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-3"},"6343":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#基线与追踪","content":"| 方法                                    | 用途                            |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `replaceStateWithoutHistory(updater)` | 仅限拥有状态的时间线：更新状态、清空历史记录、建立新基线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-3"},"6344":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#基线与追踪","content":"| 方法                                     | 用途                             |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `pauseTracking()` / `resumeTracking()` | 仅限拥有状态的时间线：应用未被追踪的更新，并将其纳入新基线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-3"},"6345":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#基线与追踪","content":"应谨慎使用这些方法；它们会改变之后的撤销与重置操作所能触及的范围。","locale":"zh"},"6346":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"| 方法             | 所有权与用途        |\n| -------------- | ------------- |\n| `getHistory()` | 共享的缓存只读状态时间线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-4"},"6347":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"| 方法                     | 所有权与用途             |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `getHistorySnapshot()` | 与缓存分离、归调用方所有的历史状态。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-4"},"6348":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"| 方法             | 所有权与用途            |\n| -------------- | ----------------- |\n| `getPatches()` | 与缓存分离的保留正向/反向补丁组。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-4"},"6349":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"| 方法              | 所有权与用途                              |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `getMetadata()` | 与保留条目对齐的元数据；若存在待处理的手动工作，也包含该工作的元数据。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-4"},"6350":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"| 方法                    | 所有权与用途           |\n| --------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `getHistoryEntries()` | 正向/反向条目以及可选的元数据。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-4"},"6351":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"| 方法              | 所有权与用途                        |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `getControls()` | 为拥有状态的时间线提供的、缓存且冻结的导航/只读接口对象。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-4"},"6352":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#历史记录读取","content":"`getHistorySnapshot()` 会复制受支持的运行时值，但不强制满足完整的持久化 JSON 契约。严格的持久化校验由 `serialize({ strict: true })` 或 `assertPersistenceCompatible()` 负责。","locale":"zh"},"6353":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#持久化","content":"| API                   | 用途                      |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `serialize(options?)` | 返回一个分离的、带版本号的状态/历史记录快照。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-5"},"6354":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#持久化","content":"| API                             | 用途                               |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `assertPersistenceCompatible()` | 针对不可持久化的状态、补丁、路径或元数据，抛出带具体路径的诊断。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-5"},"6355":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#持久化","content":"| API                                    | 用途               |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `Travels.deserialize(input, options?)` | 在恢复之前解析、迁移并校验快照。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-5"},"6356":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#持久化","content":"| API                                  | 用途               |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| `restoreTravels(snapshot, options?)` | 以原子方式恢复拥有状态的时间线。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-5"},"6357":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/instance-methods#持久化","content":"| API                                       | 用途                     |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `restoreTravelJournal(snapshot, options)` | 以原子方式恢复由外部拥有的 Journal。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-