/docs/reference/options","locale":"zh"},"6366":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options","content":"时间线创建、恢复、持久化、补丁、钩子与 Mutative 选项参考。","locale":"zh"},"6367":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"时间线选项","locale":"zh"},"6368":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"观察者与生命周期钩子","locale":"zh"},"6369":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"恢复选项","locale":"zh"},"6370":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#序列化选项","content":"序列化选项","locale":"zh"},"6371":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"反序列化选项","locale":"zh"},"6372":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#能力专属选项","content":"能力专属选项","locale":"zh"},"6373":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options","content":"工厂函数重载会根据你提供的选项推断归档模式与补丁选项。确切的生成类型见 `TravelsOptions` 与 `RestoreTravelsOptions`。","locale":"zh"},"6374":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项           | 类型       | 默认值  | 用途                 |\n| ------------ | -------- | ---- | ------------------ |\n| `maxHistory` | `number` | `10` | 保留的补丁条目上限；必须是非负整数。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6375":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项            | 类型        | 默认值    | 用途                                  |\n| ------------- | --------- | ------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `autoArchive` | `boolean` | `true` | 自动归档每次有效更新，或暴露手动的 `archive()` 控制接口。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6376":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项        | 类型        | 默认值     | 用途                               |\n| --------- | --------- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `mutable` | `boolean` | `false` | 把补丁应用到实时对象，适用于依赖引用同一性的响应式 Store。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6377":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项                       | 类型        | 默认值           | 用途                    |\n| ------------------------ | --------- | ------------- | --------------------- |\n| `warnOnUnsupportedState` | `boolean` | 开发环境中为 `true` | 为状态、补丁、路径与元数据启用兼容性诊断。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6378":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项               | 类型              | 默认值  | 用途                                  |\n| ---------------- | --------------- | ---- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `patchesOptions` | `PatchesOption` | `{}` | 自定义补丁的表示形式，包括 `pathAsArray`；补丁无法禁用。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6379":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项                 | 类型        | 默认值     | 用途                                |\n| ------------------ | --------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `enableAutoFreeze` | `boolean` | `false` | 冻结生成的不可变状态；与 `mutable: true` 不兼容。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6380":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项       | 类型                   | 默认值     | 用途                         |\n| -------- | -------------------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `strict` | Mutative `strict` 选项 | `false` | 与 Mutative 更严格的不可变性行为保持一致。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6381":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"| 选项     | 类型                 | 默认值          | 用途                           |\n| ------ | ------------------ | ------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `mark` | Mutative `mark` 选项 | Mutative 默认值 | 自定义 Mutative 将哪些对象视为不可变或可起草。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6382":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#时间线选项","content":"底层 `strict`、`mark` 与自动冻结语义见 Mutative 文档。如果记录持久化历史时使用了自定义 `strict` 或 `mark`，请在语义反序列化期间通过 `replayOptions` 传入匹配的值。","locale":"zh"},"6383":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"| 选项         | 传入参数                 | 运行时机              |\n| ---------- | -------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `devtools` | `TravelsEvent<S, P>` | 每次事件提交后，与订阅者一同触发。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6384":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"| 选项        | 传入参数           | 运行时机                                    |\n| --------- | -------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `onError` | 包装后的核心 `Error` | Travels 报告核心操作失败时；嵌套事务中的错误会在根事务结算时统一上报。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6385":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"| 选项                | 传入参数                      | 运行时机           |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `onBranchDiscard` | `{ position, discarded }` | 已提交的编辑移除重做条目后。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6386":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"| 选项          | 传入参数                | 运行时机                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `onWarning` | `{ code, message }` | 用于非致命的规范化、兼容性、位置与历史记录警告。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6387":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"| 选项                | 传入参数                | 运行时机                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `onObserverError` | `{ source, error }` | 监听器或生命周期/诊断钩子在提交后抛出异常时。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-1"},"6388":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#观察者与生命周期钩子","content":"观察者错误不会回滚已提交的转换。钩子函数不应同步修改同一条时间线。","locale":"zh"},"6389":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"`restoreTravels(snapshot, options?)` 接受适用的创建选项，但有意不接受单独的 `initialState` 或 `history`；完整快照才是原子的状态/历史记录输入。","locale":"zh"},"6390":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"在 **3.0.1** 中，恢复工厂接受快照对象，直接传入的 `validation` 选项会被忽略。要校验对象或 JSON 字符串，可使用 `restoreTravels(Travels.deserialize<State>(stored, { validation: 'semantic' }))`。","locale":"zh"},"6391":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"下一个 3.x 次版本（尚未发布）将支持直接传入 JSON 字符串和 `validation: 'semantic'` 恢复选项。启用该选项后，Travels 会按照恢复选项中的 `strict` 与 `mark` 校验完整历史，然后才会写入目标对象或裁剪历史。","locale":"zh"},"6392":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"对于可变模式集成，它还接受：","locale":"zh"},"6393":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#恢复选项","content":"`target` 必须是兼容的对象或数组根，并且要求 `mutable: true`。Travels 会用分离的快照状态就地覆盖它。`restoreTravelJournal(snapshot, { apply, ...options })` 则要求外部所有者提供同步的导航回调，并且不暴露与拥有状态相关的可变选项。","locale":"zh"},"6394":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#序列化选项","content":"`strict` 会拒绝任何无法通过文档中定义的 JSON 持久化契约往返的当前状态、保留的补丁值/路径或元数据。如果只想校验而不创建快照，可使用 `assertPersistenceCompatible()`。","locale":"zh"},"6395":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"| 选项           | 用途                                           |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `validation` | 默认值为 `'structural'`；`'semantic'` 还会双向重放可达条目。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6396":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"| 选项         | 用途                        |\n| ---------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fallback` | 检测到解析、迁移或校验失败后使用的快照或同步工厂。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6397":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"| 选项        | 用途                  |\n| --------- | ------------------- |\n| `migrate` | 把旧输入转换为当前快照模式的同步回调。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6398":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"| 选项        | 用途                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `onError` | 在回退或抛出之前接收 `TravelsPersistenceError`。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6399":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"| 选项              | 用途                                            |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `replayOptions` | 用于语义重放、与记录时一致的 Mutative `strict` 与 `mark` 设置。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-2"},"6400":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#反序列化选项","content":"所有存储、网络、解压缩与应用层封装校验工作，都应在同步反序列化调用之前完成。","locale":"zh"},"6401":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#能力专属选项","content":"`createTravels()` 掌管更新，并支持 `mutable`、追踪、事务与控制接口。","locale":"zh"},"6402":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#能力专属选项","content":"`createPatchableTravels()` 接受持久化状态契约，并立即校验初始状态。","locale":"zh"},"6403":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#能力专属选项","content":"`createTravelJournal()` 要求提供 `apply`，并拒绝与拥有状态相关的可变选项。","locale":"zh"},"6404":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#能力专属选项","content":"自动时间线不包含 `archive()` 与 `canArchive()`；手动工厂会在运行时与 TypeScript 中暴露它们。","locale":"zh"},"6405":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/options-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/options#能力专属选项","content":"这些区分采用故障关闭策略，而不是静默忽略与所有权相关的选项。","locale":"zh"},"6406":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"page","content":"TypeScript 指南","breadcrumbs":["Travels","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","locale":"zh"},"6407":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","content":"推断时间线类型、约束持久状态，并安全使用只读视图与开放事件类型。","locale":"zh"},"6408":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#从工厂函数推断状态类型","content":"从工厂函数推断状态类型","locale":"zh"},"6409":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"重要的导出类型","locale":"zh"},"6410":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#持久化输入检查","content":"持久化输入检查","locale":"zh"},"6411":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#只读视图","content":"只读视图","locale":"zh"},"6412":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#开放的事件名称","content":"开放的事件名称","locale":"zh"},"6413":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#包声明","content":"包声明","locale":"zh"},"6414":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","content":"Travels 使用 TypeScript 编写，并为 ESM 与 CommonJS 使用方提供声明文件。大多数应用可以依赖工厂函数的类型推断，而不必逐个写出泛型参数。","locale":"zh"},"6415":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#从工厂函数推断状态类型","content":"你也可以显式提供状态类型：","locale":"zh"},"6416":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                    | 用途          |\n| --------------------- | ----------- |\n| `Travels<S, F, A, P>` | 拥有状态的时间线能力。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6417":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                          | 用途                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `TravelJournal<S, F, A, P>` | 由外部拥有的 Journal 能力。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6418":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                           | 用途            |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------- |\n| `TravelsOptions<F, A, P, S>` | 工厂选项，包括观察者钩子。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6419":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型           | 用途                 |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| `Updater<S>` | 直接状态、返回状态的函数或草稿函数。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6420":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                 | 用途           |\n| ------------------ | ------------ |\n| `TravelPatches<P>` | 保留的正向与反向补丁组。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6421":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                      | 用途            |\n| ----------------------- | ------------- |\n| `TravelHistoryEntry<P>` | 一个补丁对及可选的元数据。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6422":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型               | 用途                |\n| ---------------- | ----------------- |\n| `TravelMetadata` | 标签、时间戳、来源与自定义元数据。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6423":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                   | 用途                  |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `TravelsEvent<S, P>` | 统一的订阅者/devtools 事件。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6424":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                               | 用途          |\n| -------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `TravelsSerializedHistory<S, P>` | 带版本号的持久化快照。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6425":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                 | 用途         |\n| ------------------ | ---------- |\n| `ReadonlyState<S>` | 共享的只读状态视图。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6426":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                         | 用途               |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `ReadonlyTravelPatches<P>` | 共享的、冻结的事件本地补丁视图。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6427":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                             | 用途               |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| `JsonValue` / `PatchableState` | 持久的 JSON 形态数据契约。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6428":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"| 类型                  | 用途               |\n| ------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `PatchableInput<T>` | 对持久化输入的尽力而为静态约束。 |","locale":"zh","table":"table-0"},"6429":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#重要的导出类型","content":"`F`、`A`、`P` 参数分别追踪自动冻结、归档模式与补丁格式，因此特定能力的方法只会在有效时出现。在应用边界处优先使用推断，并为自己的 API 定义更简单的别名。","locale":"zh"},"6430":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#持久化输入检查","content":"`PatchableInput<T>` 使用有限深度的递归检查，因此递归接口仍然可用。宽泛或类似 `any` 的类型无法证明运行时内容，TypeScript 的 `number` 也无法排除 `NaN`、无穷大或 `-0`。在不可信边界仍应保留运行时校验。","locale":"zh"},"6431":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#只读视图","content":"`getHistory()` 返回 `readonly ReadonlyState<S>[]`；观察者的状态视图与补丁视图同样是只读的。这些类型描述的是共享缓存与借用的事件值，并不表示可以强制转换后修改。","locale":"zh"},"6432":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#只读视图","content":"`getControls()` 与 Journal 接口对象在所有构建中都是冻结的。它们收窄的类型有助于防止状态所有权意外泄漏到展示组件中。","locale":"zh"},"6433":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#开放的事件名称","content":"`TravelsEvent['type']` 接受已知名称，也接受未来新增的字符串。不要使用穷尽的 `never` 断言，否则次版本新增事件后就会失效：","locale":"zh"},"6434":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#包声明","content":"该包通过导出映射提供开发版与默认 ESM 构建、CommonJS 默认构建与声明文件、UMD 以及类型声明。请根据应用情况使用能够理解包导出的现代 TypeScript 模块解析模式，例如 `bundler`、`node16` 或 `nodenext`。","locale":"zh"},"6435":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/typescript#包声明","content":"由源码生成的类型别名参考包含本版本确切的泛型约束与返回结构。","locale":"zh"},"6436":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","type":"page","content":"参与贡献","breadcrumbs":["Travels","资源"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","locale":"zh"},"6437":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","content":"配置仓库、进行聚焦的改动并验证贡献。","locale":"zh"},"6438":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing#开发环境配置","content":"开发环境配置","locale":"zh"},"6439":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing#pull-request-要求","content":"Pull Request 要求","locale":"zh"},"6440":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing#兼容性","content":"兼容性","locale":"zh"},"6441":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/contributing#发布流程","content":"发布流程","loca