list#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"如果主版本更改了工厂函数或恢复边界，请按依赖顺序发布：","locale":"zh"},"6493":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"完成本清单中所有 Travels 检查项，并基于经过测试的确切产物发布 `travels@3`。","locale":"zh"},"6494":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"在干净的 `use-travel` 与 `zustand-travel` 检出目录中安装已发布的核心包。把它们的 `mutative` peer 范围与开发依赖范围提升到 Travels 要求的范围（Travels 3 为 `^2.0.0`），将锁文件更新到已发布版本，并重新运行每个仓库的类型检查、测试、生产构建与包冒烟测试。","locale":"zh"},"6495":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"只有这些基于已发布核心包的运行全部通过后，才发布各绑定的主版本。","locale":"zh"},"6496":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"在一个干净的使用方项目中，把三个已发布包全部与 `mutative@2` 一起安装，确认安装过程没有报告 peer 依赖冲突，并对新建时间线与原子恢复的时间线做冒烟测试。","locale":"zh"},"6497":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"本地同级链接是有用的候选证据，但不能取代第 2 步和第 4 步中针对已发布包的检查。不要为需要未发布核心版本的绑定发布打标签。","locale":"zh"},"6498":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"推送 `main`，然后创建并推送匹配的发布标签：","locale":"zh"},"6499":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"标签必须与 `package.json` 中的版本完全一致，并以 `v` 开头。","locale":"zh"},"6500":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"发布任务会自行选择 npm dist-tag：高于已发布 `latest` 的版本会成为 `latest`，预发布版本会成为 `next`，较旧主版本的维护版本会成为 `v<major>-latest`（例如 `v2-latest`），因此它绝不会替换当前主版本。","locale":"zh"},"6501":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"确认由标签触发的发布流程已完成：","locale":"zh"},"6502":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"`Release`","locale":"zh"},"6503":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"`API Docs`，由 `Release` 使用发布标签触发","locale":"zh"},"6504":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"文档工作流会将发布标签对应的网站构建发布到 `gh-pages`。GitHub Pages 的发布源应设为该分支的根目录。需要独立于软件包发布更新站点时，请从仓库根目录运行 `pnpm run deploy:doc:site`。","locale":"zh"},"6505":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"对已发布包做冒烟测试：","locale":"zh"},"6506":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","type":"page","content":"安全策略","breadcrumbs":["Travels","资源"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/security","locale":"zh"},"6507":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security","content":"受支持的版本与负责任的漏洞报告流程。","locale":"zh"},"6508":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#受支持的版本","content":"受支持的版本","locale":"zh"},"6509":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"报告漏洞","locale":"zh"},"6510":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#受支持的版本","content":"安全修复会提供给 `travels` 的最新次版本。","locale":"zh"},"6511":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"请通过为本仓库提交 GitHub 安全公告的方式私下报告安全问题。不要为漏洞提交公开 issue。","locale":"zh"},"6512":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"请包含：","locale":"zh"},"6513":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"受影响的版本","locale":"zh"},"6514":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"复现步骤","locale":"zh"},"6515":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"影响与受影响的 API","locale":"zh"},"6516":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"任何已知的变通方案","locale":"zh"},"6517":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/security-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/security#报告漏洞","content":"维护者会尽快确认有效的报告、评估严重程度，并在需要时发布包含补丁的版本。","locale":"zh"},"6518":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","type":"page","content":"测试策略","breadcrumbs":["Travels","资源"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","locale":"zh"},"6519":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","content":"正确性测试、基于属性的测试、浏览器测试、变异测试与热路径性能测试。","locale":"zh"},"6520":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#变异冒烟测试","content":"变异冒烟测试","locale":"zh"},"6521":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#热路径预算","content":"热路径预算","locale":"zh"},"6522":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","content":"Travels 结合了基于示例的测试、基于属性的测试、浏览器测试、包使用方测试、覆盖率测试与变异冒烟测试。","locale":"zh"},"6523":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#变异冒烟测试","content":"运行：","locale":"zh"},"6524":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#变异冒烟测试","content":"该冒烟套件会临时引入一小组高价值的正确性回归，并验证针对性测试确实失败。每个源文件都会在 `finally` 块中还原。这些变异覆盖反向重放顺序、Journal 的补丁对校验，以及可变事务回滚的完整性。","locale":"zh"},"6525":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#变异冒烟测试","content":"这是有意设置的确定性关卡，而不是大规模的概率性变异活动。只要某个缺陷修复依赖于行覆盖率本身无法保护的细微运算符、边界条件或回滚步骤，就应补充一个变异。","locale":"zh"},"6526":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#热路径预算","content":"运行：","locale":"zh"},"6527":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#热路径预算","content":"矩阵基准测试为 `setState` 吞吐量与序列化历史记录大小把关。它不覆盖撤销/重做导航或 Journal：曾有一项变更让受控导航比 2.1.0 系列慢 53 倍、外部提交慢 5.5 倍，却仍通过了检查，未被察觉。","locale":"zh"},"6528":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/testing#热路径预算","content":"`benchmarks/hot-path-check.js` 测量 `setState`、导航、事务以及两条 Journal 路径的单次操作开销，并在任一项超出预算时使构建失败。这些预算属于数量级层面的冒烟上限，设置得远高于实测开销，以免共享 CI 运行器出现偶发失败；同样出于这一原因，每个场景取三次运行中的最佳结果。它们不是百分比级别的漂移检测器。只有在取得可测量的改进时才应收紧预算；每当有新操作进入时间线的热路径时，都应增加一个场景。","locale":"zh"},"6529":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"故障排查","breadcrumbs":["Travels","资源"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","locale":"zh"},"6530":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","content":"诊断常见的更新、导航、持久化、可变模式与集成问题。","locale":"zh"},"6531":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"更新没有出现在历史记录中","locale":"zh"},"6532":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"撤销或重做按钮没有更新","locale":"zh"},"6533":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#instanceof-travels-失败或抛出异常","content":"`instanceof Travels` 失败或抛出异常","locale":"zh"},"6534":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"恢复快照时抛出异常","locale":"zh"},"6535":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#json-持久化会丢失值","content":"JSON 持久化会丢失值","locale":"zh"},"6536":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#可变-store-丢失根引用或根引用意外变化","content":"可变 Store 丢失根引用或根引用意外变化","locale":"zh"},"6537":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#事务没有回滚全部内容","content":"事务没有回滚全部内容","locale":"zh"},"6538":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#观察者错误或重入变更","content":"观察者错误或重入变更","locale":"zh"},"6539":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"Journal 的历史记录与所有者不一致","locale":"zh"},"6540":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#网站需要-markdown-或-llm-版本","content":"网站需要 Markdown 或 LLM 版本","locale":"zh"},"6541":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#仍未解决","content":"仍未解决","locale":"zh"},"6542":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","content":"用以下各节判断问题究竟属于状态所有权、历史记录写入、重放、持久化，还是 UI 绑定。稳定的错误码与警告码见错误处理。","locale":"zh"},"6543":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"按顺序检查以下情况：","locale":"zh"},"6544":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"**值是否真的发生了变化？** 空操作补丁组不会创建条目，也不会发布事件。","locale":"zh"},"6545":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"**是否设置了 `autoArchive: false`？** 待处理的更新需要调用 `archive()`，或执行会隐式归档它们的操作。","locale":"zh"},"6546":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"**追踪是否已暂停？** 请在 `finally` 块中恢复追踪。","locale":"zh"},"6547":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"**你是否通过 Travels 写入？** 直接对 `getState()` 的返回值、MobX/Vue Store 或其他所有者赋值不会被记录。","locale":"zh"},"6548":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"**是否使用了 Journal？** 请用所有者提供的精确补丁对调用 `recordPatches()`；Journal 有意不提供 `setState()`。","locale":"zh"},"6549":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"**更新函数是否抛出异常或返回了 Promise？** 请保持回调同步，并在调用前等待数据就绪。","locale":"zh"},"6550":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#更新没有出现在历史记录中","content":"用 `getRevision()` 确认是否发生了已提交事件，用 `subscribe()` 检查事件类型。","locale":"zh"},"6551":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"仅靠状态引用不足以刷新控件。`archive()` 与 `rebase()` 可以在不替换状态的情况下改变时间线。","locale":"zh"},"6552":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"在 React 中，使用 `useSyncExternalStore(travels.subscribe, travels.getRevision)` 订阅。","locale":"zh"},"6553":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"在其他 Store 中，每次已提交事件后同步 `getRevision()` 或相关的控件状态。","locale":"zh"},"6554":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"确认订阅没有被提前销毁。","locale":"zh"},"6555":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"不要在每次组件渲染时新建时间线。","locale":"zh"},"6556":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#撤销或重做按钮没有更新","content":"参见导航与控件。","locale":"zh"},"6557":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#instanceof-travels-失败或抛出异常","content":"导出的 `Travels` 值是持久化命名空间，在 Travels 3 中不是构造函数。请用 `createTravels()` 创建实例，并用 `isTravels(value)` 检测。Journal 不是拥有状态的 Travels 实例，该类型守卫会返回 `false`。","locale":"zh"},"6558":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"先解析存储内容，再假定其结构；`Travels.deserialize()` 接受 JSON 字符串或已解析的对象。","locale":"zh"},"6559":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"对未经校验的输入使用 `validation: 'semantic'`，以便在恢复时检测出无效重放。","locale":"zh"},"6560":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"如果记录时自定义了 `strict` 与 `mark`，请通过 `replayOptions` 传入匹配的设置。","locale":"zh"},"6561":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"在校验前迁移旧的应用数据结构与历史记录结构。","locale":"zh"},"6562":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"检查 `TravelsPersistenceError.code`，以及存在时的 `entryIndex` 与 `direction`。","locale":"zh"},"6563":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"为有意的启动恢复提供已知安全的 `fallback`。","locale":"zh"},"6564":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#恢复快照时抛出异常","content":"在 v3 中不要传入单独的 `history`、`initialPatches` 或 `initialPosition` 选项。请把完整快照传给 `restoreTravels()`。","locale":"zh"},"6565":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#json-持久化会丢失值","content":"JSON 无法保留 `undefined`、`bigint`、`NaN`、无穷大、`-0`、原型、Map/Set、循环引用或共享对象标识。部分值会抛出异常，其他值则会被静默转换或丢弃。","locale":"zh"},"6566":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#json-持久化会丢失值","content":"运行：","locale":"zh"},"6567":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#json-持久化会丢失值","content":"然后检查报告中给出的路径，并按照状态要求规范化该值。注意，不兼容的值在离开当前状态后仍可能保留在旧补丁中。","locale":"zh"},"6568":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#可变-store-丢失根引用或根引用意外变化","content":"检查操作是否替换了根、使用了原始类型根，或通过根替换补丁进行导航。优先使用局部草稿修改。恢复时，把被观察的对象作为 `target` 传入，并设置 `mutable: true`：","locale":"zh"},"6569":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#可变-store-丢失根引用或根引用意外变化","content":"不要把可变模式与 `enableAutoFreeze` 一起使用。完整的操作行为见各操作的行为表。","locale":"zh"},"6570":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#事务没有回滚全部内容","content":"Travels 会回滚通过自身 API 完成的写入。它无法回滚对可变 Store 的直接赋值、网络请求、DOM 变更、存储写入或其他外部副作用。","locale":"zh"},"6571":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#事务没有回滚全部内容","content":"把每一次可撤销的状态写入都放进 `setState()`，保持回调同步，并在提交成功后处理外部副作用，或采用单独的补偿策略。直接挂到可变状态上的框架观察者也可能看到临时写入，而 Travels 的观察者看不到。","locale":"zh"},"6572":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#观察者错误或重入变更","content":"观察者在提交后运行。它们无法否决或安全地变更同一次转换。把后续工作安排到之后的任务中，并避免循环。使用 `onObserverError` 隔离监听器或 devtools 的故障；观察者异常不会回滚已经提交的状态。","locale":"zh"},"6573":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"记录同一次转换提交后的精确状态，以及精确的正向/反向补丁对。","locale":"zh"},"6574":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"不要在 Travels 内部重复执行更新函数。","locale":"zh"},"6575":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"不要把 `apply` 触发的导航记录为新的编辑。","locale":"zh"},"6576":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"让 `apply` 同步执行，并返回实际提交的状态。","locale":"zh"},"6577":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"就地应用补丁时，显式处理根替换。","locale":"zh"},"6578":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"当所有者无法回滚已发布的提交时，用 `assertTravelHistoryEntryRecordable()` 预检。","locale":"zh"},"6579":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#journal-的历史记录与所有者不一致","content":"Travels 会校验补丁结构，但有意不重新生成补丁来证明所有者的转换。这一对应关系由适配器负责。","locale":"zh"},"6580":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#网站需要-markdown-或-llm-版本","content":"每个文档页面都可通过页面上的复制/查看控件获取 Markdown。站点还导出 `/llms.txt` 与 `/llms-full.txt`，用于文档发现与全文消费。这些路由描述的是文档站点，不会改变 Travels 的运行时行为。","locale":"zh"},"6581":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/troubleshooting#仍未解决","content":"对照一个可运行的示例，然后提交 GitHub issue，附上最小复现、Travels 与 Mutative 版本、运行时/浏览器信息、稳定的错误码，以及能展示该问题的最小状