ack()`, `forward()`, `go()`, and `reset()` compose the necessary patches and invoke the required `apply` callback:"],[5591,"`back()`、`forward()`、`go()` 和 `reset()` 会组合必要的补丁并调用所需的 `apply` 回调："],[2214,"`batch()` is an alias for `transaction()`. Transaction callbacks must be synchronous; failures roll back changes made through Travels APIs. Learn more in Transactions."],[5505,"`batch()` 是 `transaction()` 的别名。事务回调必须是同步的；如果执行失败，通过 Travels API 所做的更改会回滚。更多内容见事务。"],[3237,"`benchmarks/hot-path-check.js` measures per-operation cost for `setState`, navigation, transactions, and both controlled-journal paths, and fails the build when one exceeds its budget. The budgets are order-of-magnitude smoke limits, set far above the measured cost so shared CI runners do not flake; each scenario takes the best of three runs for the same reason. They are not percent-level drift detectors. Tighten a budget only alongside a measured improvement, and add a scenario whenever a new operation joins the timeline's hot path."],[6528,"`benchmarks/hot-path-check.js` 测量 `setState`、导航、事务以及两条 Journal 路径的单次操作开销，并在任一项超出预算时使构建失败。这些预算属于数量级层面的冒烟上限，设置得远高于实测开销，以免共享 CI 运行器出现偶发失败；同样出于这一原因，每个场景取三次运行中的最佳结果。它们不是百分比级别的漂移检测器。只有在取得可测量的改进时才应收紧预算；每当有新操作进入时间线的热路径时，都应增加一个场景。"],[431,"`boolean`"],[433,"`boolean`"],[682,"`boolean`"],[684,"`boolean`"],[762,"`boolean`"],[957,"`boolean`"],[959,"`boolean`"],[1147,"`boolean`"],[1151,"`boolean`"],[1156,"`boolean`"],[1240,"`boolean`"],[1244,"`boolean`"],[1637,"`boolean`"],[1639,"`boolean`"],[3721,"`boolean`"],[3723,"`boolean`"],[3972,"`boolean`"],[3974,"`boolean`"],[4052,"`boolean`"],[4247,"`boolean`"],[4249,"`boolean`"],[4438,"`boolean`"],[4442,"`boolean`"],[4447,"`boolean`"],[4531,"`boolean`"],[4535,"`boolean`"],[4928,"`boolean`"],[4930,"`boolean`"],[79,"`CallSite`[]"],[171,"`CallSite`[]"],[253,"`CallSite`[]"],[3369,"`CallSite`[]"],[3461,"`CallSite`[]"],[3543,"`CallSite`[]"],[2941,"`clear()` removes everything in the current store. Use `removeItem(key)` for a single Travels snap