y<P>` | One patch pair with optional metadata. |"],[3125,"| Type                  | Purpose                           |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `Travels<S, F, A, P>` | State-owning timeline capability. |"],[3132,"| Type                 | Purpose                            |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TravelsEvent<S, P>` | Unified subscriber/devtools event. |"],[3137,"| Type                | Purpose                                          |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `PatchableInput<T>` | Best-effort static constraint for durable input. |"],[3129,"| Type               | Purpose                                    |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `TravelPatches<P>` | Retained forward and inverse patch groups. |"],[3134,"| Type               | Purpose                      |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `ReadonlyState<S>` | Shared read-only state view. |"],[3131,"| Type             | Purpose                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `TravelMetadata` | Labels, timestamps, source, and custom metadata. |"],[3128,"| Type         | Purpose                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Updater<S>` | Direct state, state-returning function, or draft recipe. |"],[2104,"| Value                                 | Runtime behavior                      | JSON persistence       | Recommendation                   |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Sparse, extended, or subclassed array | Limited or rejected by durable checks | Shape is not preserved | Normalize to a dense plain array |"],[2114,"| Value              