nus"],[361,"metadata?"],[611,"metadata?"],[887,"metadata?"],[1089,"metadata?"],[1426,"metadata?"],[1584,"metadata?"],[1795,"metadata?"],[1970,"metadata?"],[3651,"metadata?"],[3901,"metadata?"],[4177,"metadata?"],[4380,"metadata?"],[4717,"metadata?"],[4875,"metadata?"],[5086,"metadata?"],[5261,"metadata?"],[24,"Methods"],[110,"Methods"],[198,"Methods"],[3314,"Methods"],[3400,"Methods"],[3488,"Methods"],[1772,"Migrate old persisted snapshots into the current schema before validation.\nThe callback must return synchronously; perform asynchronous I/O before\ncalling `deserialize()`."],[5063,"Migrate old persisted snapshots into the current schema before validation.\nThe callback must return synchronously; perform asynchronous I/O before\ncalling `deserialize()`."],[3270,"Migrate older application and history shapes before validation."],[2824,"Migrate older snapshots"],[2823,"Migrate older snapshots, select validation depth, and recover intentionally from invalid history."],[2850,"Migrate to the current snapshot schema."],[1756,"migrate?"],[5047,"migrate?"],[2895,"Migration and Corruption Recovery"],[2833,"Migration and function-valued fallback callbacks are synchronous. Read storage, fetch remote data, decompress bytes, and verify envelopes before calling `deserialize()`. Promise-like callback results fail with `MIGRATION_FAILED` or `FALLBACK_FAILED`; Travels consumes their rejection to avoid an unhandled Promise rejection."],[2788,"Migration and function-valued fallback callbacks must return synchronously. Complete asynchronous storage or network work before calling `Travels.deserialize(...)`; Promise-like callback results are rejected as `MIGRATION_FAILED` or `FALLBACK_FAILED` without leaking an unhandled rejection."],[2822,"Migration and Recovery"],[2709,"Migration Guide"],[3019,"Minor releases may add APIs and warnings while preserving existing behavior."],[2653,"MobX"],[5944,"MobX"],[2394,"MobX (simplified observable)"],[2651,"MobX and Pinia"],[2658,"MobX and Pinia